          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"id\":\"326675\",\"title\":\"500 Miles\",\"runtime\":6120,\"genres\":\"Drama, Comedy\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1e30b60b502bff79f72f40d8c7a702c0.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"386762\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Morgan\",\"lastName\":\"Matthews\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Bill\",\"lastName\":\"Nighy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Roman Griffin\",\"lastName\":\"Davis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Maisie\",\"lastName\":\"Williams\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dexter\",\"lastName\":\"Sol Ansell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Clare\",\"lastName\":\"Dunne\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michael\",\"lastName\":\"Socha\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"500 Miles\",\"synopsis\":\"500 MILES is a poetic, life-affirming road movie and celebration of the human spirit that follows a broken family who are forced to come together when two young brothers run away from home.\\n\\nWhile their fighting parents (Clare Dunne & Michael Socha) tear their hair out with worry, runaways Finn (Roman Griffin Davis) and his live-wire younger brother Charlie (Dexter Sol Ansell) embark on an epic adventure from Yorkshire, over land and sea, to the Wild West coast of Ireland. With the free-spirited busker Cate (Maisie Williams) helping the young boys along the way, their destination is Dingle, County Kerry, and their estranged, beloved Grandfather (BAFTA-award winner Bill Nighy), who their parents haven’t spoken to since the fateful events of the previous summer.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/1c/ef/1cef9210b67e00af75d028b76f66c3a3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/386762_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/386762_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000112319\",\"name\":\"True Brit Entertainment Ltd.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"infrequent strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1e30b60b502bff79f72f40d8c7a702c0.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/95acbdb14cca1d9636aebc0029727aa3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"500 Miles\",\"synopsis\":\"500 MILES is a poetic, life-affirming road movie and celebration of the human spirit that follows a broken family who are forced to come together when two young brothers run away from home.\\n\\nWhile their fighting parents (Clare Dunne & Michael Socha) tear their hair out with worry, runaways Finn (Roman Griffin Davis) and his live-wire younger brother Charlie (Dexter Sol Ansell) embark on an epic adventure from Yorkshire, over land and sea, to the Wild West coast of Ireland. With the free-spirited busker Cate (Maisie Williams) helping the young boys along the way, their destination is Dingle, County Kerry, and their estranged, beloved Grandfather (BAFTA-award winner Bill Nighy), who their parents haven’t spoken to since the fateful events of the previous summer.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Bill Nighy\",\"Roman Griffin Davis\",\"Maisie Williams\",\"Dexter Sol Ansell\",\"Clare Dunne\",\"Michael Socha\"],\"direction\":[\"Morgan Matthews\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/95acbdb14cca1d9636aebc0029727aa3.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/95acbdb14cca1d9636aebc0029727aa3.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"infrequent strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/386762_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/386762_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"True Brit Entertainment Ltd.\"},\"orderIndex\":16},{\"id\":\"1000000193\",\"title\":\"A Private Life\",\"runtime\":6420,\"genres\":\"Detective, Thriller, Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/39/62/396248a2d955c01d22ee8a9f1a8c0f6a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"359130\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/28/4a/284ac6768238e504021be7935dc7c4a2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/45/95/4595310a91f77595ec5e503f85d1c1c3.png\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fd/96/fd967c31c115c8a78af6687abd599abe.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9b/17/9b17d74c1a1de5397df0ee11efaa75c6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d7/80/d78067482df043fed6785826e700ae28.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/27/ff2764deae99cfe29dcfd0ba1006281a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/80/62/806253da47d2356653c480c6917da799.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0f/9a/0f9ab5ffe30b5650c87c5041f5beba49.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6e/da/6edab50b919fc9005e28b8842a1d8f3f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/eb/10/eb10ae737edab7497bb48c23c25d64df.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Rebecca\",\"lastName\":\"Zlotowski\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jodie\",\"lastName\":\"Foster\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Auteuil\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Virginie\",\"lastName\":\"Efira\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mathieu\",\"lastName\":\"Amalric\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Vincent\",\"lastName\":\"Lacoste\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Luàna\",\"lastName\":\"Bajrami\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sophie\",\"lastName\":\"Guillemin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Noam\",\"lastName\":\"Morgensztern\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Frederick\",\"lastName\":\"Wiseman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Aurore\",\"lastName\":\"Clément\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"A Private Life\",\"synopsis\":\"The renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner mounts a private investigation into the death of one of her patients, whom she is convinced has been murdered.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/39/62/396248a2d955c01d22ee8a9f1a8c0f6a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/359130_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/359130_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/37856c7434b9a1b1e1c9c8362b0ee3ff.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"33240\",\"name\":\"Altitude Films\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Vie Privée\",\"synopsis\":\"The renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner mounts a private investigation into the death of one of her patients, whom she is convinced has been murdered.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Jodie Foster\",\"Daniel Auteuil\",\"Virginie Efira\",\"Mathieu Amalric\",\"Vincent Lacoste\",\"Luàna Bajrami\",\"Sophie Guillemin\",\"Noam Morgensztern\",\"Frederick Wiseman\",\"Aurore Clément\"],\"direction\":[\"Rebecca Zlotowski\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/28/4a/284ac6768238e504021be7935dc7c4a2.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/45/95/4595310a91f77595ec5e503f85d1c1c3.png\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fd/96/fd967c31c115c8a78af6687abd599abe.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9b/17/9b17d74c1a1de5397df0ee11efaa75c6.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d7/80/d78067482df043fed6785826e700ae28.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/27/ff2764deae99cfe29dcfd0ba1006281a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/80/62/806253da47d2356653c480c6917da799.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0f/9a/0f9ab5ffe30b5650c87c5041f5beba49.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6e/da/6edab50b919fc9005e28b8842a1d8f3f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/eb/10/eb10ae737edab7497bb48c23c25d64df.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/37856c7434b9a1b1e1c9c8362b0ee3ff.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/359130_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/359130_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Altitude Films\"},\"orderIndex\":10},{\"id\":\"1000046717\",\"title\":\"Alhan Presents: Jockeys of Jamaica\",\"runtime\":3300,\"genres\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/6b27bee95d2c52034923bb59e004a48e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"419110\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"directors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Alhan Presents: Jockeys of Jamaica\",\"synopsis\":\"What really goes down at Jamaica’s oldest racecourse?\\nJoin Alhan Gençay as he visits Belvedere Race Track in Westmoreland, uncovering Jamaica’s rich history of horse racing.\\nHe meets the local jockeys, trainers and the betters who, more than 100 years on, continue to keep the race track alive. Horse racing draws a huge crowd, and with it comes passion, pride and fierce rivalry.\\nJockeys of Jamaica is a warm, funny and unexpected look at a community built around one of the island’s oldest sporting traditions.\\nThis marks Alhan’s first major independent documentary, and he is bringing it to the big screen for an exclusive cinema preview before it goes online.\\nEach screening will also include a live Q&A with Alhan, plus a first look at teasers from his upcoming documentary projects.\",\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/6b27bee95d2c52034923bb59e004a48e.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us at select Everyman venues from 13 July to 16 July for a special screening of Jockeys of Jamaica, followed by a Live Q&A with Alhan Gençay, to find out what really goes down at Jamaica’s oldest racecourse.\\n\\nJoin Alhan as he visits Belvedere Race Track in Westmoreland, uncovering Jamaica’s rich history of horse racing.\\n\\nHe meets the local jockeys, trainers and the betters who, more than 100 years on, continue to keep the race track alive. Horse racing draws a huge crowd, and with it comes passion, pride and fierce rivalry.\\n\\nJockeys of Jamaica is a warm, funny and unexpected look at a community built around one of the island’s oldest sporting traditions.\\n \\nThis marks Alhan’s first major independent documentary, and he is bringing it to the big screen for an exclusive cinema preview before it goes online.\\n\\nEach screening will also include a live introduction and Q&A with Alhan, plus a first look at teasers from his upcoming documentary projects.\\n\\nDATES:\\nEveryman Manchester - Monday 13 July\\nEveryman Birmingham - Tuesday 14 July\\nEveryman Bristol - Wednesday 15 July\\nEveryman at The Whiteley - Thursday 16 July\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/f5594cbba00c9ad97cc7803940d32265.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Alhan Presents: Jockeys of Jamaica\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us at select Everyman venues from 13 July to 16 July for a special screening of Jockeys of Jamaica, followed by a Live Q&A with Alhan Gençay, to find out what really goes down at Jamaica’s oldest racecourse.\\n\\nJoin Alhan as he visits Belvedere Race Track in Westmoreland, uncovering Jamaica’s rich history of horse racing.\\n\\nHe meets the local jockeys, trainers and the betters who, more than 100 years on, continue to keep the race track alive. Horse racing draws a huge crowd, and with it comes passion, pride and fierce rivalry.\\n\\nJockeys of Jamaica is a warm, funny and unexpected look at a community built around one of the island’s oldest sporting traditions.\\n \\nThis marks Alhan’s first major independent documentary, and he is bringing it to the big screen for an exclusive cinema preview before it goes online.\\n\\nEach screening will also include a live introduction and Q&A with Alhan, plus a first look at teasers from his upcoming documentary projects.\\n\\nDATES:\\nEveryman Manchester - Monday 13 July\\nEveryman Birmingham - Tuesday 14 July\\nEveryman Bristol - Wednesday 15 July\\nEveryman at The Whiteley - Thursday 16 July\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/f5594cbba00c9ad97cc7803940d32265.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/f5594cbba00c9ad97cc7803940d32265.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-07-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":18},{\"id\":\"1000039379\",\"title\":\"André Rieu’s 2026 Summer Concert: Viva Maastricht!\",\"runtime\":9900,\"genres\":\"Concert\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"410664\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a3/bb/a3bb42d398c1dd294d4b8312a3099781.webp\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"André\",\"lastName\":\"Rieu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"André\",\"lastName\":\"Rieu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"The Johann Strauss Orchestra\",\"lastName\":null,\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"André Rieu’s 2026 Summer Concert: Viva Maastricht!\",\"synopsis\":\"This year, André Rieu celebrates a spectacular milestone — the 20th anniversary of his iconic summer concerts on the magnificent Vrijthof square. Captured live in his beloved hometown, this brand-new cinema event marks two decades of music and unforgettable magical summer nights.\\n\\nViva Maastricht! is a joyful tribute to the city where it all began. Joined by his world-renowned Johann Strauss Orchestra and a vibrant ensemble of artists, André brings the spirit, culture, and warmth of his hometown to life in a dazzling new concert filled with emotion and wonder.\\n\\nFrom timeless waltzes to soul-stirring classics, this landmark anniversary concert promises an evening of passion, joy, and togetherness. Be part of this historic celebration as the Vrijthof once again transforms into a breathtaking open-air ballroom — only in cinemas this summer.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a3/bb/a3bb42d398c1dd294d4b8312a3099781.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-08-08T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"43134\",\"name\":\"Piece of Magic Entertainment\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"André Rieu's 2026 Summer Concert: Viva Maastricht!\",\"synopsis\":\"This year, André Rieu celebrates a spectacular milestone — the 20th anniversary of his iconic summer concerts on the magnificent Vrijthof square. Captured live in his beloved hometown, this brand-new cinema event marks two decades of music and unforgettable magical summer nights.\\n\\nViva Maastricht! is a joyful tribute to the city where it all began. Joined by his world-renowned Johann Strauss Orchestra and a vibrant ensemble of artists, André brings the spirit, culture, and warmth of his hometown to life in a dazzling new concert filled with emotion and wonder.\\n\\nFrom timeless waltzes to soul-stirring classics, this landmark anniversary concert promises an evening of passion, joy, and togetherness. Be part of this historic celebration as the Vrijthof once again transforms into a breathtaking open-air ballroom — only in cinemas this summer.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"André Rieu\",\"The Johann Strauss Orchestra\"],\"direction\":[\"André Rieu\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-08-08T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Piece of Magic Entertainment\"},\"orderIndex\":37},{\"id\":\"269068\",\"title\":\"Avengers: Doomsday\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Adventure, Action\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"335353\",\"409522\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/33/7e/337e24e9cf074b87c97f0685f282ab10.jpeg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Joe\",\"lastName\":\"Russo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Anthony\",\"lastName\":\"Russo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Robert\",\"lastName\":\"Downey Jr.\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Vanessa\",\"lastName\":\"Kirby\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Joseph\",\"lastName\":\"Quinn\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor