 a furniture showroom.\\n\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Backrooms: Everything Must Go Edition w/ Bonus Footage\",\"synopsis\":\"Backrooms returns to Everyman with an additional 15 minutes of footage.\\n\\nA strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.\\n\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Chiwetel Ejiofor\",\"Renate Reinsve\",\"Mark Duplass\",\"Finn Bennett\",\"Lukita Maxwell\",\"Avan Jogia\",\"Krista Kosonen\",\"Philip Granger\",\"Robert Bobroczkyi\",\"Ember Ambrose\"],\"direction\":[\"Kane Parsons\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language, violence, injury detail, horror\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"A24\"},\"orderIndex\":9},{\"id\":\"1000048635\",\"title\":\"Beyond: A Private Life\",\"runtime\":6420,\"genres\":\"Detective, Thriller, Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/8aef1f72191791c008b98569d2689796.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"421418\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Rebecca\",\"lastName\":\"Zlotowski\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jodie\",\"lastName\":\"Foster\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Auteuil\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Virginie\",\"lastName\":\"Efira\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mathieu\",\"lastName\":\"Amalric\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Vincent\",\"lastName\":\"Lacoste\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Luàna\",\"lastName\":\"Bajrami\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Beyond: A Private Life\",\"synopsis\":\"The renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner mounts a private investigation into the death of one of her patients, whom she is convinced has been murdered.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ac/34/ac349d9e19d1464bc762569f3652ee1a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"33240\",\"name\":\"Altitude Films\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/8aef1f72191791c008b98569d2689796.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"When renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner learns of the death of one of her patients, she is convinced it was murder and takes it upon herself to investigate…\\n\\nBeyond screens every Monday matinee and Tuesday evening, showcasing independent films that might not be on your radar (yet!) but are well worth experiencing on the big screen.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Beyond: A Private Life\",\"synopsis\":\"When renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner learns of the death of one of her patients, she is convinced it was murder and takes it upon herself to investigate…\\n\\nBeyond screens every Monday matinee and Tuesday evening, showcasing independent films that might not be on your radar (yet!) but are well worth experiencing on the big screen.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Jodie Foster\",\"Daniel Auteuil\",\"Virginie Efira\",\"Mathieu Amalric\",\"Vincent Lacoste\",\"Luàna Bajrami\"],\"direction\":[\"Rebecca Zlotowski\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong language, sex, nudity, violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Altitude Films\"},\"orderIndex\":60},{\"id\":\"1000048636\",\"title\":\"Beyond: Effi o Blaenau\",\"runtime\":5400,\"genres\":\"Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/b486a4a2019ed8c26f659c1cc71b3367.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"421420\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Marc\",\"lastName\":\"Evans\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Leisa\",\"lastName\":\"Gwenllian\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tom Rhys\",\"lastName\":\"Harries\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Owen\",\"lastName\":\"Alun\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Nel Rhys\",\"lastName\":\"Lewis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mared\",\"lastName\":\"Llywelyn\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sion\",\"lastName\":\"Eifion\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Beyond: Effi o Blaenau\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Gary Owen's much lauded and widely performed monodrama, Iphigenia in Splott, Effi o Blaenau is director Marc Evans' cinematic interpretation set against the wide open landscapes of North Wales.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c5/6c/c56cba11a845aca20b637f1ae28fdafc.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000108794\",\"name\":\"MetFilm\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/b486a4a2019ed8c26f659c1cc71b3367.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Gary Owen's much lauded and widely performed monodrama, Iphigenia in Splott, 'Effi o Blaenau' is director Marc Evans' cinematic interpretation set against the wide open landscapes of North Wales. \\n\\nThe film follows Effi, a young woman desperate to escape a town where the pubs are closed, the jobs have vanished, and her grandmother works night shifts in the local chip shop just to get by. A chance encounter in a Llandudno nightclub with injured soldier Lee, played by Tom Rhys Harries, briefly opens a door to something better. For a moment, Effi glimpses a life she never imagined. The reality that follows is far tougher. \\n\\nBeyond screens every Monday matinee and Tuesday evening, showcasing independent films that might not be on your radar (yet!) but are well worth experiencing on the big screen.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Beyond: Effi o Blaenau\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Gary Owen's much lauded and widely performed monodrama, Iphigenia in Splott, 'Effi o Blaenau' is director Marc Evans' cinematic interpretation set against the wide open landscapes of North Wales. \\n\\nThe film follows Effi, a young woman desperate to escape a town where the pubs are closed, the jobs have vanished, and her grandmother works night shifts in the local chip shop just to get by. A chance encounter in a Llandudno nightclub with injured soldier Lee, played by Tom Rhys Harries, briefly opens a door to something better. For a moment, Effi glimpses a life she never imagined. The reality that follows is far tougher. \\n\\nBeyond screens every Monday matinee and Tuesday evening, showcasing independent films that might not be on your radar (yet!) but are well worth experiencing on the big screen.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Leisa Gwenllian\",\"Tom Rhys Harries\",\"Owen Alun\",\"Nel Rhys Lewis\",\"Mared Llywelyn\",\"Sion Eifion\"],\"direction\":[\"Marc Evans\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-07-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"MetFilm\"},\"orderIndex\":59},{\"id\":\"1000047646\",\"title\":\"Beyond: The Last Viking\",\"runtime\":6960,\"genres\":\"Comedy, Drama, Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/edb5f4911de0a21889ed78c69fda69c1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"420236\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Anders Thomas\",\"lastName\":\"Jensen\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mads\",\"lastName\":\"Mikkelsen\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Nikolaj\",\"lastName\":\"Lie Kaas\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lars\",\"lastName\":\"Brygmann\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Beyond: The Last Viking\",\"synopsis\":\"A bank robber released from jail must unlock his traumatised brother's memory to recover stolen loot.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/8c/fa/8cfa201b1ba20da2147920f80009bac0.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong violence, bloody images, domestic abuse, threat, language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/edb5f4911de0a21889ed78c69fda69c1.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"After serving fifteen years in prison, bank robber Anker (Nikolaj Lie Kaas) is determined to recover the stolen money his brother Manfred (Mads Mikkelsen) buried years earlier. There's just one problem: Manfred, caught in an identity crisis and convinced he is John Lennon, can no longer remember where it is hidden. The brothers set off on an increasingly chaotic hunt for the missing fortune, digging up old family secrets on the way.\\n\\nBeyond screens every Monday matinee and Tuesday evening, showcasing independent films that might not be on your radar (yet!) but are well worth experiencing on the big screen.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Beyond: The Last Viking\",\"synopsis\":\"After serving fifteen years in prison, bank robber Anker (Nikolaj Lie Kaas) is determined to recover the stolen money his brother Manfred (Mads Mikkelsen) buried years earlier. There's just one problem: Manfred, caught in an identity crisis and convinced he is John Lennon, can no longer remember where it is hidden. The brothers set off on an increasingly chaotic hunt for the missing fortune, digging up old family secrets on the way.\\n\\nBeyond screens every Monday matinee and Tuesday evening, showcasing independent films that might not be on your radar (yet!) but are well worth experiencing on the big screen.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Mads Mikkelsen\",\"Nikolaj Lie Kaas\",\"Lars Brygmann\"],\"direction\":[\"Anders Thomas Jensen\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong violence, bloody images, domestic abuse, threat, language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":58},{\"id\":\"1000027149\",\"title\":\"Blue Heron\",\"runtime\":5400,\"genres\":\"Drama\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"395896\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3a77af56a6cd7adaf4f2a84569e58e6b.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9b/0d/9b0d54ef6e5a6e3cbc604b0e79019894.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fc/61/fc61269014459cc1c309e1df88c054a1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/da/f1/daf19b55f472bf0748f4808a55d80866.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/14/e6/14e6e31001634fc79cf2572ba1d31102.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/78/5c/785ce4135b6940d5a29e1315c87a234f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a7/42/a74212a0f02f8d2de8c42f9885d4559a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/48/44/4844ef7e0455310dbc08979580c4c3e0.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Sophy\",\"lastName\":\"Romvari\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Eylul\",\"lastName\":\"Guven\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Amy\",\"lastName\":\"Zimmer\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Iringó\",\"lastName\":\"Retí\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Edik\",\"lastName\":\"Beddoes\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ádám\",\"lastName\":\"Tompa\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Liam\",\"lastName\":\"Serg\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Preston\",\"lastName\":\"Drabble\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lucy\",\"lastName\":\"Turnbull\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jecca\",\"lastName\":\"Beauchamp\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Blue Heron\",\"synopsis\":\"Set on Vancouver Island in the late 1990s, Blue Heron follows eight‑year‑old Sasha and her Hungarian immigrant family as they attempt to build a new life, only to be destabilised by the increasingly dangerous behaviour of her older brother, Jeremy. Drawing on her own memories, filmmaker Sophy Romvari shapes a deeply personal portrait of childhood, family fractures, and the fragility of recollection.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/92/4e/924e8764d94a5841305c979cf6807bee.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000109968\",\"name\":\"Conic\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3a77af56a6cd7adaf4f2a84569e58e6b.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/538e06afb725680ddd0ef775ec542b0c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Blue Heron\",\"synopsis\":\"Set on Vancouver Island in the late 1990s, Blue Heron follows eight‑year‑old Sasha and her Hungarian immigrant family as they attempt to build a new life, only to be destabilised by the increasingly dangerous behaviour of her older brother, Jeremy. Drawing on her own memories, filmmaker Sophy Romvari shapes a deeply personal portrait of childhood, family fractures, and the fragility of recollection.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Eylul Guven\",\"Amy Zimmer\",\"Iringó Retí\",\"Edik Beddoes\",\"Ádám Tompa\",\"Liam Serg\",\"Preston Drabble\",\"Lucy Turnbull\",\"Jecca Beauchamp\"],\"direction\":[\"Sophy Romvari\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/538e06afb725680ddd0ef775ec542b0c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9b/0d/9b0d54ef6e5a6e3cbc604b0e79019894.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fc/61/fc61269014459cc1c309e1df88c054a1.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/da/f1/daf19b55f472bf0748f4808a55d80866.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/14/e6/14e6e31001634fc79cf2572ba1d31102.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/78/5c/785ce4135b6940d5a29e1315c87a234f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a7/42/a74212a0f02f8d2de8c42f9885d4559a.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/538e06afb725680ddd0ef775ec542b0c.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-06-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Conic\"},\"orderIndex\":31},{\"id\":\"1000044936\",\"title\":\"Chasing Utopia\",\"runtime\":4500,\"genres\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ddab241502608000f5700c1a3237637f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"416973\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Alex\",\"lastName\":\"Holmes\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Chasing Utopia\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0c/bc/0cbc984f5ebc90ffe63a8bfa697f164c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-05-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"moderate violence, sex references, infrequent strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ddab241502608000f5700c1a3237637f.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Artificial Intelligence already touches almost everybody’s lives each day, whether through active use or indirectly through infrastructure. Yet the ramification of these technologies is poorly understood, provision for its management and use incoherent and inadequate. AI’s extraordinary pace of evolution outpaces governments, regulators and even public debate. This is the Inconvenient Truth of AI –Chasing Utopia is the one film everyone affected by AI must see.\\n\\nWe stand at the crossroads where humanity’s survival is threatened. Will AI be our greatest achievement, or our ultimate downfall?\\n\\nMo sets out to answer the questions all of us should ask: what does life alongside AI truly look like, how can it best benefit us, what specific threats does it pose to our lives, and how do we ensure it doesn't cost us everything?\\n\\nThis film follows his journey from Shanghai to Bhutan, to New York, Toronto and London to discover the answers while there is still time. He engages with the leading players whose insight can help us shape our future, including Geoffrey Hinton, Yoshua Bengio, Fei-Fei Li, Max Tegmark, David Chalmers and Ya-Qin Zhang\\n\\nIn this sobering film, Mo Gawdat offers us what might be the only way forwards to save humanity - while we still can.\\n\\nThe film is directed by BAFTA-winning Alex Holmes (House of Saddam, Dunkirk and Maiden) and Lina Zilinskaite, and produced by BAFTA-winning Anthony Geﬀen (Hawking: Can you Hear me? The Wildest Dream: Conquest of Everest).\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Chasing Utopia\",\"synopsis\":\"Artificial Intelligence already touches almost everybody’s lives each day, whether through active use or indirectly through infrastructure. Yet the ramification of these technologies is poorly understood, provision for its management and use incoherent and inadequate. AI’s extraordinary pace of evolution outpaces governments, regulators and even public debate. This is the Inconvenient Truth of AI –Chasing Utopia is the one film everyone affected by AI must see.\\n\\nWe stand at the crossroads where humanity’s survival is threatened. Will AI be our greatest achievement, or our ultimate downfall?\\n\\nMo sets out to answer the questions all of us should ask: what does life alongside AI truly look like, how can it best benefit us, what specific threats does it pose to our lives, and how do we ensure it doesn't cost us everything?\\n\\nThis film follows his journey from Shanghai to Bhutan, to New York, Toronto and London to discover the answers while there is still time. He engages with the leading players whose insight can help us shape our future, including Geoffrey Hinton, Yoshua Bengio, Fei-Fei Li, Max Tegmark, David Chalmers and Ya-Qin Zhang\\n\\nIn this sobering film, Mo Gawdat offers us what might be the only way forwards to save humanity - while we still can.\\n\\nThe film is directed by BAFTA-winning Alex Holmes (House of Saddam, Dunkirk and Maiden) and Lina Zilinskaite, and produced by BAFTA-winning Anthony Geﬀen (Hawking: Can you Hear me? The Wildest Dream: Conquest of Everest).\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Alex Holmes\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-05-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"moderate violence, sex references, infrequent strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"1000016901\",\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Horror, Thriller, Drama\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"382489\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d0/d2/d0d271834aae7997f18f906afedb01f7.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/11/50/115070415a45416315f811f43de7e00f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d0/d2/d0d271834aae7997f18f906afedb01f7.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3e/d4/3ed4ccd725a539f8eb431b3bb372c493.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"James\",\"lastName\":\"Watkins\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tom Rhys\",\"lastName\":\"Harries\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Naomi\",\"lastName\":\"Ackie\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Max\",\"lastName\":\"Minghella\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Eddie\",\"lastName\":\"Marsan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jake\",\"lastName\":\"Curran\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jean-Pascal\",\"lastName\":\"Heynemand\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lorraine\",\"lastName\":\"Tai\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"R.A.\",\"lastName\":\"Donnelly\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Chris\",\"lastName\":\"Cutler\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jessica\",\"lastName\":\"Grundle\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"synopsis\":\"DC Studios’ first-ever foray into the genre, “Clayface” is a horror thriller from director James Watkins, starring Tom Rhys Harries in the title role of the Gotham City villain.\\n \\n“Clayface” unravels one man’s horrifying descent from rising Hollywood star to revenge-filled monster in a story that explores the loss of one’s identity and humanity, corrosive love, and the dark underbelly of scientific ambition.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/05/d3/05d37be5d6cacf1dd606282ccee27284.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/382489_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/382489_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13759\",\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d0/d2/d0d271834aae7997f18f906afedb01f7.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/05d4820b6a00a81e4fcbe0b0052832d1.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Clayface\",\"synopsis\":\"DC Studios’ first-ever foray into the genre, “Clayface” is a horror thriller from director James Watkins, starring Tom Rhys Harries in the title role of the Gotham City villain.\\n \\n“Clayface” unravels one man’s horrifying descent from rising Hollywood star to revenge-filled monster in a story that explores the loss of one’s identity and humanity, corrosive love, and the dark underbelly of scientific ambition.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Tom Rhys Harries\",\"Naomi Ackie\",\"Max Minghella\",\"Eddie Marsan\",\"Jake Curran\",\"Jean-Pascal Heynemand\",\"Lorraine Tai\",\"R.A. Donnelly\",\"Chris Cutler\",\"Jessica Grundle\"],\"direction\":[\"James Watkins\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/05d4820b6a00a81e4fcbe0b0052832d1.jpeg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/11/50/115070415a45416315f811f43de7e00f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d0/d2/d0d271834aae7997f18f906afedb01f7.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3e/d4/3ed4ccd725a539f8eb431b3bb372c493.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/05d4820b6a00a81e4fcbe0b0052832d1.jpeg\"],\"release\":\"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/382489_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/382489_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"}},{\"id\":\"280892\",\"title\":\"David Byrne's American Utopia\",\"runtime\":8100,\"genres\":\"Music, Documentary\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"311864\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a03e48632884f09556a9152edda2c6d9.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/61/16/6116da6cef77799c193bdee982a9177a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/73/f5/73f59e28138bdb7baceeca4114a1663c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0c/a2/0ca26d14591f479aeebfa0b1ce1a1885.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/51/85/51851df011e272d5b01e21771cc6f03d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Spike\",\"lastName\":\"Lee\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"David\",\"lastName\":\"Byrne\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"David Byrne’s American Utopia\",\"synopsis\":\"Directed by Oscar-winner Spike Lee, DAVID BYRNE'S AMERICAN UTOPIA is a groundbreaking cinematic event that inspires audiences to connect with each other and with the global community. This filmed version of the electrifying Broadway musical sensation brings Oscar, Grammy, and Golden Globe-winning musician David Byrne (Talking Heads) together with 11 musical artists from around the world to perform songs from across Byrne's career. Hailed by critics as \\\"pure bliss,\\\" the performance is a joyful celebration of music and dance, a call to action to engage in our democracy, and an invitation to reimagine our own utopias. Featuring a special introduction by David Byrne and an exclusive conversation between Byrne and director Spike Lee.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4d/b2/4db2036e626bd35a82221222d1f79a53.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"9611\",\"name\":\"Dogwoof Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"infrequent strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"David Byrne's American Utopia\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a03e48632884f09556a9152edda2c6d9.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us on Thursday, 6 August, for one night only as David Byrne’s American Utopia returns to Everyman - experience it like never before in stunning 4K alongside a special pre-recorded introduction by David Byrne.\\n\\nDirected by Oscar-winner Spike Lee, David Byrne’s American Utopia is a groundbreaking cinematic event that inspires audiences to connect with each other and with the global community. \\n\\nThis filmed version of the electrifying Broadway musical sensation brings Oscar, Grammy, and Golden Globe-winning musician David Byrne (Talking Heads) together with 11 musical artists from around the world to perform songs from across Byrne's career. Hailed by critics as \\\"pure bliss,\\\" the performance is a joyful celebration of music and dance, a call to action to engage in our democracy, and an invitation to reimagine our own utopias. \",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fcf9157c4a5a1c23317506739afe481d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"David Byrne’s American Utopia\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us on Thursday, 6 August, for one night only as David Byrne’s American Utopia returns to Everyman - experience it like never before in stunning 4K alongside a special pre-recorded introduction by David Byrne.\\n\\nDirected by Oscar-winner Spike Lee, David Byrne’s American Utopia is a groundbreaking cinematic event that inspires audiences to connect with each other and with the global community. \\n\\nThis filmed version of the electrifying Broadway musical sensation brings Oscar, Grammy, and Golden Globe-winning musician David Byrne (Talking Heads) together with 11 musical artists from around the world to perform songs from across Byrne's career. Hailed by critics as \\\"pure bliss,\\\" the performance is a joyful celebration of music and dance, a call to action to engage in our democracy, and an invitation to reimagine our own utopias. \",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"David Byrne\"],\"direction\":[\"Spike Lee\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fcf9157c4a5a1c23317506739afe481d.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/61/16/6116da6cef77799c193bdee982a9177a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/73/f5/73f59e28138bdb7baceeca4114a1663c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0c/a2/0ca26d14591f479aeebfa0b1ce1a1885.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/51/85/51851df011e272d5b01e21771cc6f03d.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fcf9157c4a5a1c23317506739afe481d.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-08-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"infrequent strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Dogwoof Pictures\"},\"orderIndex\":32},{\"id\":\"327174\",\"title\":\"Digger\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Action, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"373163\"],\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/e3/ffe3562c1f69542605cdba2887fab54d.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typena