 powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity’s savior before the disaster he’s unleashed destroys everything.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ff/e3/ffe3562c1f69542605cdba2887fab54d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/d62040780203ba21d333e95cfc8c8352.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13759\",\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Digger\",\"synopsis\":\"The most powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity’s savior before the disaster he’s unleashed destroys everything.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Tom Cruise\",\"Sandra Hüller\",\"Riz Ahmed\",\"John Goodman\",\"Michael Stuhlbarg\",\"Jesse Plemons\",\"Sophie Wilde\",\"Emma D'Arcy\",\"Corey Johnson\",\"Danny Kirrane\"],\"direction\":[\"Alejandro González Iñárritu\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/d62040780203ba21d333e95cfc8c8352.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"}},{\"id\":\"1000001453\",\"title\":\"Disclosure Day\",\"runtime\":8700,\"genres\":\"Science fiction, Thriller\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"361251\",\"409688\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/pro