ches of Dunkirk. Under air and ground cover from British and French forces, troops were slowly and methodically evacuated from the beach using every serviceable naval and civilian vessel that could be found. At the end of this heroic mission, 330,000 French, British, Belgian and Dutch soldiers were safely evacuated.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f9/b8/f9b872db6f3d1778ef972f5c2dde3a36.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/225351_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/225351_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2017-07-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13759\",\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"sustained threat, intense sequences, moderate violence, strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}},{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-08-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"12048\",\"name\":\"Park Circus\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/270bcb48c16cd69b9c5c8353efc5a3c3.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/62bb09eba0a44c78725ba99aabe7cf42.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Dunkirk\",\"synopsis\":\"In May 1940, Germany advanced into France, trapping Allied troops on the beaches of Dunkirk. Under air and ground cover from British and French forces, troops were slowly and methodically evacuated from the beach using every serviceable naval and civilian vessel that could be found. At the end of this heroic mission, 330,000 French, British, Belgian and Dutch soldiers were safely evacuated.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Fionn Whitehead\",\"Mark Rylance\",\"Tom Hardy\",\"Harry Styles\",\"Barry Keoghan\",\"Aneurin Barnard\",\"Kenneth Branagh\",\"Jack Lowden\",\"James D'Arcy\",\"Cillian Murphy\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Nolan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/62bb09eba0a44c78725ba99aabe7cf42.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/01/20/12/49/518736.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/01/20/12/49/519830.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/12/491450.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/12/490513.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/12/490044.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/13/259575.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/12/490669.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/12/489731.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/12/492075.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/17/07/07/11/13/140356.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/62bb09eba0a44c78725ba99aabe7cf42.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2017-07-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"sustained threat, intense sequences, moderate violence, strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/225351_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/225351_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"}},{\"id\":\"1000041000\",\"title\":\"Effi o Blaenau\",\"runtime\":5400,\"genres\":\"Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e96174e410b9b10fff94747101d4fea6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"412539\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/70/d7/70d7609167f468e51296b54f34ee95d9.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Marc\",\"lastName\":\"Evans\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Leisa\",\"lastName\":\"Gwenllian\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tom Rhys\",\"lastName\":\"Harries\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Owen\",\"lastName\":\"Alun\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sion\",\"lastName\":\"Eifion\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Leah\",\"lastName\":\"Gaffey\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Nel Rhys\",\"lastName\":\"Lewis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Effi o Blaenau\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Gary Owen's much lauded and widely performed monodrama, Iphigenia in Splott, Effi o Blaenau is director Marc Evans' cinematic interpretation set against the wide open landscapes of North Wales.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e2/8d/e28d847c31838263118930ae77672972.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-06-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000108794\",\"name\":\"MetFilm\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e96174e410b9b10fff94747101d4fea6.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Gary Owen's much lauded and widely performed monodrama, Iphigenia in Splott, Effi o Blaenau is director Marc Evans' cinematic interpretation set against the wide open landscapes of North Wales.\\nThe film follows Effi, a young woman who learns firsthand the personal costs of our societal shortcomings. \\n\\nGrappling with her weekly loop of unemployment, clubbing and hangovers, Effi has a chance encounter in a Llandudno nightclub with injured soldier Lee, briefly opening a door to something better.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Effi o Blaenau\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Gary Owen's much lauded and widely performed monodrama, Iphigenia in Splott, Effi o Blaenau is director Marc Evans' cinematic interpretation set against the wide open landscapes of North Wales.\\nThe film follows Effi, a young woman who learns firsthand the personal costs of our societal shortcomings. \\n\\nGrappling with her weekly loop of unemployment, clubbing and hangovers, Effi has a chance encounter in a Llandudno nightclub with injured soldier Lee, briefly opening a door to something better.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Leisa Gwenllian\",\"Tom Rhys Harries\",\"Owen Alun\",\"Sion Eifion\",\"Leah Gaffey\",\"Nel Rhys Lewis\"],\"direction\":[\"Marc Evans\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-06-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizat