n is given the wrong number for his dream girl, he teams up with a driven psychology student to find her. Together, they spark a hilarious campus-wide frenzy that tests their own hearts and ambitions along the way.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/67/fa/67fa9b44e1bcf2668dff1df351c7082c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/373290_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/373290_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/7c27687ed965429b735cc102a33bd24b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-05-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13733\",\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"moderate sex references, drug references, infrequent strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/43bd23a3abc3bb050e1a39a2d6c5ffa6.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Finding Emily\",\"synopsis\":\"When a lovesick musician is given the wrong number for his dream girl, he teams up with a driven psychology student to find her. Together, they spark a hilarious campus-wide frenzy that tests their own hearts and ambitions along the way.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Angourie Rice\",\"Spike Fearn\",\"Yali Topol Margalith\",\"Ella Maisy Purvis\",\"Nadia Parkes\",\"Anthony J. Abraham\",\"Cora Kirk\",\"Jack Riddiford\",\"Kat Ronney\",\"Jessica Grundle\"],\"direction\":[\"Alicia MacDonald\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b5/cb/b5cb2d22f927630b4f8f438b5db5ea9a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c4/16/c4164b49ee5a322ead9ccd495d253642.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/dc/7d/dc7dc4dd64473e0dda3b6236f8ce7c52.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c5/1a/c51a35e97d3a1cb169f0219a52cd236a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/7c/2a/7c2a291482e451012ba7278749ddf1c2.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/90/dc/90dc82373f1ecc4353d246a3853d3c5e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ab/b6/abb67f917f8deba168a8a971b70c8ebd.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/7c27687ed965429b735cc102a33bd24b.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-05-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"moderate sex references, drug references, infrequent strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/373290_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/373290_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\"}},{\"id\":\"1000046327\",\"title\":\"GIANT - The Play\",\"runtime\":8160,\"genres\":\"Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/008b58393ee3b730573da04ce143a033.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"418643\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/74/ce/74ce316575cc0cdac1cc19f3c95ff462.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Nicholas\",\"lastName\":\"Hytner\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"John\",\"lastName\":\"Lithgow\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Elliot\",\"lastName\":\"Levey\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Aya\",\"lastName\":\"Cash\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rachael\",\"lastName\":\"Stirling\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tessa\",\"lastName\":\"Bonham Jones\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Richard\",\"lastName\":\"Hope\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Giant - The Play\",\"synopsis\":\"A world-famous children’s author under threat. A battle of wills in the wake of scandal. And one chance to make amends…It’s the summer of 1983, The Witches is about to hit the shelves and Roald Dahl is making last-minute edits.  But the outcry at his recent, explicitly antisemitic article won’t die down. Across a single afternoon at his family home, and rocked by an unexpectedly explosive confrontation, Dahl is forced to choose: make a public apology or risk his name and reputation. Inspired by real events, GIANT explores with dark humour the difference between considered opinion and dangerous rhetoric offering a complicated portrait of a fiendishly charismatic icon.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a2/51/a2518d7ca6b03065527893d9043838d6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"GIANT - The Play\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/008b58393ee3b730573da04ce143a033.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"GIANT, the 5-star critically acclaimed play starring John Lithgow (Killers of the Flower Moon, The Crown) as Roald Dahl, comes to the big screen. Winner of 3 Olivier Awards®, including Best Play and a Tony Award® for Best Actor in a Play (John Lithgow), the production was filmed live in London’s West End ahead of its sold-out Broadway run. \\n\\nThe stellar cast includes Aya Cash (The Boys, The Franchise, You’re the Worst), Elliot Levey (Cold War, Patriots, Good) and Rachael Stirling (The Divine Mrs S).\\n\\nA world-famous children’s author under threat. A battle of wills in the wake of scandal. And one chance to make amends...It’s the summer of 1983, The Witches is about to hit the shelves, and Roald Dahl is making last-minute edits.  But the outcry at his recent, explicitly antisemitic article won’t die down. \\n\\nAcross a single afternoon at his family home, and rocked by an unexpectedly explosive confrontation, Dahl is forced to choose: make a public apology or risk his name and reputation. Inspired by real events, GIANT explores with dark humour the difference between considered opinion and dangerous rhetoric, offering a complicated portrait of a fiendishly charismatic icon.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Giant - The Play\",\"synopsis\":\"GIANT, the 5-star critically acclaimed play starring John Lithgow (Killers of the Flower Moon, The Crown) as Roald Dahl, comes to the big screen. Winner of 3 Olivier Awards®, including Best Play and a Tony Award® for Best Actor in a Play (John Lithgow), the production was filmed live in London’s West End ahead of its sold-out Broadway run. \\n\\nThe stellar cast includes Aya Cash (The Boys, The Franchise, You’re the Worst), Elliot Levey (Cold War, Patriots, Good) and Rachael Stirling (The Divine Mrs S).\\n\\nA world-famous children’s author under threat. A battle of wills in the wake of scandal. And one chance to make amends...It’s the summer of 1983, The Witches is about to hit the shelves, and Roald Dahl is making last-minute edits.  But the outcry at his recent, explicitly antisemitic article won’t die down. \\n\\nAcross a single afternoon at his family home, and rocked by an unexpectedly explosive confrontation, Dahl is forced to choose: make a public apology or risk his name and reputation. Inspired by real events, GIANT explores with dark humour the difference between considered opinion and dangerous rhetoric, offering a complicated portrait of a fiendishly charismatic icon.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"John Lithgow\",\"Elliot Levey\",\"Aya Cash\",\"Rachael Stirling\",\"Tessa Bonham Jones\",\"Richard Hope\"],\"direction\":[\"Nicholas Hytner\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":38},{\"id\":\"312529\",\"title\":\"Hexed\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"399781\",\"409519\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/5ff79d206275f506a2c22ef6039b872a.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Fawn\",\"lastName\":\"Veerasunthorn\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jason\",\"lastName\":\"Hand\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Josie\",\"lastName\":\"Trinidad\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Hexed\",\"synopsis\":\"In Walt Disney Animation Studios' all-new magical coming-of-age saga, “Hexed,” an impulsive and unconventional teenage girl named Billie (voice of Hailee Steinfeld) discovers secret magical abilities which, once unleashed, hurtle her into a spectacle-filled journey out of suburbia and into a vast witch realm called Hexe. Forced to team up with her cautious mother, Alice (voice of Rashida Jones), they uncover family mysteries that could change the world of witches forever.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/db/91/db91ee712f179985d3b8d32abf6ab5cb.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/399781_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/399781_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-11-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Hailee\",\"lastName\":\"Steinfeld\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rashida\",\"lastName\":\"Jones\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tracey\",\"lastName\":\"Ullman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Stephen\",