 follows young Haymitch Abernathy (Joseph Zada) twenty-four years before the events of The Hunger Games, starting on the morning of the reaping of the Fiftieth Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/02/a4/02a416edaed779eceebe3db2b8fc0054.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/365727_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/365727_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13832\",\"name\":\"Lionsgate UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/447bf95d7f9dbedf183074bbf77e3376.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Explores Panem 24 years before Katniss' saga, starting on the morning of the reaping for the 50th Hunger Games, where a young Haymitch Abernathy participates.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7627c96e4d21fdf51949ade14a6257d2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Hunger Games: Sunrise On The Reaping\",\"synopsis\":\"Explores Panem 24 years before Katniss' saga, starting on the morning of the reaping for the 50th Hunger Games, where a young Haymitch Abernathy participates.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Joseph Zada\",\"Whitney Peak\",\"Mckenna Grace\",\"Jesse Plemons\",\"Kelvin Harrison Jr.\",\"Maya Hawke\",\"Lili Taylor\",\"Ben Wang\",\"Ralph Fiennes\",\"Molly McCann\"],\"direction\":[\"Francis Lawrence\"],\"c