e\":\"Holmes\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gary\",\"lastName\":\"Oldman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cillian\",\"lastName\":\"Murphy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Morgan\",\"lastName\":\"Freeman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tom\",\"lastName\":\"Wilkinson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rutger\",\"lastName\":\"Hauer\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Linus\",\"lastName\":\"Roache\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Batman Begins\",\"synopsis\":\"The tale finds the disillusioned industrial heir Bruce Wayne, in the wake of his parents' murder, traveling the world to seek the means to fight injustice and turn fear against those who prey on the fearful. He returns to Gotham and unveils his alter-ego: Batman, a masked crusader who uses his strength, intellect and an array of high tech deceptions to fight the sinister forces that threaten the city.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/df/80/df80492a356574721c829a2e9c215299.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2024-09-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"12048\",\"name\":\"Park Circus\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate horror and violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}},{\"releasedAt\":\"2005-06-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13759\",\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Batman Begins\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/0a588d77d865d3b65f98ecc96055bf80.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"The tale finds the disillusioned industrial heir Bruce Wayne, in the wake of his parents' murder, traveling the world to seek the means to fight injustice and turn fear against those who prey on the fearful. He returns to Gotham and unveils his alter-ego: Batman, a masked crusader who uses his strength, intellect and an array of high tech deceptions to fight the sinister forces that threaten the city.\\n\\nScreening in 35mm as part of Nolan Season at Everyman Screen on the Green.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/92f2397bc3921f1c5c9510bf53718a3e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Batman Begins\",\"synopsis\":\"The tale finds the disillusioned industrial heir Bruce Wayne, in the wake of his parents' murder, traveling the world to seek the means to fight injustice and turn fear against those who prey on the fearful. He returns to Gotham and unveils his alter-ego: Batman, a masked crusader who uses his strength, intellect and an array of high tech deceptions to fight the sinister forces that threaten the city.\\n\\nScreening in 35mm as part of Nolan Season at Everyman Screen on the Green.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Christian Bale\",\"Michael Caine\",\"Liam Neeson\",\"Katie Holmes\",\"Gary Oldman\",\"Cillian Murphy\",\"Morgan Freeman\",\"Tom Wilkinson\",\"Rutger Hauer\",\"Linus Roache\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Nolan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/92f2397bc3921f1c5c9510bf53718a3e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/14/03/05/11/14/171685.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876829.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876828.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876827.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876826.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876825.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876824.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876823.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876822.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/86/95/09/19876821.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/92f2397bc3921f1c5c9510bf53718a3e.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2005-06-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"},\"orderIndex\":74},{\"id\":\"1000047951\",\"title\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Dunkirk\",\"runtime\":6420,\"genres\":\"War movie, Historical, Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/85842bfc39b9597fcfb70a102c69b682.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"420642\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Nolan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Fionn\",\"lastName\":\"Whitehead\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mark\",\"lastName\":\"Rylance\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tom\",\"lastName\":\"Hardy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Dunkirk\",\"synopsis\":\"In May 1940, Germany advanced into France, trapping Allied troops on the beaches of Dunkirk. Under air and ground cover from British and French forces, troops were slowly and methodically evacuated from the beach using every serviceable naval and civilian vessel that could be found. At the end of this heroic mission, 330,000 French, British, Belgian and Dutch soldiers were safely evacuated.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f9/b8/f9b872db6f3d1778ef972f5c2dde3a36.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":null,\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"sustained threat, intense sequences, moderate violence, strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/85842bfc39b9597fcfb70a102c69b682.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"In May 1940, Germany advanced into France, trapping Allied troops on the beaches of Dunkirk. Under air and ground cover from British and French forces, troops were slowly and methodically evacuated from the beach using every serviceable naval and civilian vessel that could be found. At the end of this heroic mission, 330,000 French, British, Belgian and Dutch soldiers were safely evacuated.\\n\\nScreening in 35mm as part of Nolan Season at Everyman Screen on the Green.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Dunkirk\",\"synopsis\":\"In May 1940, Germany advanced into France, trapping Allied troops on the beaches of Dunkirk. Under air and ground cover from British and French forces, troops were slowly and methodically evacuated from the beach using every serviceable naval and civilian vessel that could be found. At the end of this heroic mission, 330,000 French, British, Belgian and Dutch soldiers were safely evacuated.\\n\\nScreening in 35mm as part of Nolan Season at Everyman Screen on the Green.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Fionn Whitehead\",\"Mark Rylance\",\"Tom Hardy\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Nolan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":null,\"advisory\":\"sustained threat, intense sequences, moderate violence, strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":80},{\"id\":\"1000048698\",\"title\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Inception\",\"runtime\":8880,\"genres\":\"Science fiction, Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/01593821182ba003c0ebe2c4f6829e46.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"421491\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Nolan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Leonardo\",\"lastName\":\"DiCaprio\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marion\",\"lastName\":\"Cotillard\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Elliot\",\"lastName\":\"Page\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Inception\",\"synopsis\":\"Dom Cobb is a skilled thief, the absolute best in the dangerous art of extraction, stealing valuable secrets from deep within the subconscious during the dream state when the mind is at its most vulnerable. Cobb's rare ability has made him a coveted player in this treacherous new world of corporate espionage, but it has also made him an international fugitive and cost him everything he has ever loved. Now, Cobb is being offered a chance at redemption. One last job could give him his life back, but only if he can accomplish the impossible -- inception.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b5/87/b587da870dee4133fd914c3b8a6aa58b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/01593821182ba003c0ebe2c4f6829e46.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Dom Cobb is a skilled thief, the absolute best in the dangerous art of extraction, stealing valuable secrets from deep within the subconscious during the dream state when the mind is at its most vulnerable. Cobb's rare ability has made him a coveted player in this treacherous new world of corporate espionage, but it has also made him an international fugitive and cost him everything he has ever loved. Now, Cobb is being offered a chance at redemption. One last job could give him his life back, but only if he can accomplish the impossible -- inception.\\n\\nScreening in 35mm as part of Nolan Season at Everyman Screen on the Green.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Inception\",\"synopsis\":\"Dom Cobb is a skilled thief, the absolute best in the dangerous art of extraction, stealing valuable secrets from deep within the subconscious during the dream state when the mind is at its most vulnerable. Cobb's rare ability has made him a coveted player in this treacherous new world of corporate espionage, but it has also made him an international fugitive and cost him everything he has ever loved. Now, Cobb is being offered a chance at redemption. One last job could give him his life back, but only if he can accomplish the impossible -- inception.\\n\\nScreening in 35mm as part of Nolan Season at Everyman Screen on the Green.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Leonardo DiCaprio\",\"Marion Cotillard\",\"Elliot Page\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Nolan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-07-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":79},{\"id\":\"1000048302\",\"title\":\"Nolan in 35mm: Interstellar\",\"runtime\":10140,\"genres\":\"Science fiction, Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9f279613d14c7195267774646370a41f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"421017\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Nolan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Matthew\",\"lastName\":\"