_typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ginger\",\"lastName\":\"Costa-Jackson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Russell\",\"lastName\":\"Thomas\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2026-27: Carmen\",\"synopsis\":\"In a remote Spanish town, the free-spirited Carmen declares that any man she loves should beware. But even she is unprepared for what happens when she decides to seduce police officer Don José. Though initially uninterested in Carmen’s charms, Don José – against the wishes of his mother and of Micaëla, the woman who loves him – soon abandons his respectable career for a life of danger with Carmen. But she soon grows weary of Don José's possessiveness, longing to return to a life of independence. When Carmen turns her attention to the celebrated toreador Escamillo, Don José’s jealousy and despair threaten to violently erupt.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a9/6a/a96ae231e459a673ac8552bf788b33a4.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/96f3fab2c26d3df9c2ae8e15e47113e7.jpeg\",\"synopsis\":\"In a remote Spanish town, the free-spirited Carmen declares that any man she loves should beware. But even she is unprepared for what happens when she decides to seduce police officer Don José. Though initially uninterested in Carmen’s charms, Don José – against the wishes of his mother and of Micaëla, the woman who loves him – soon abandons his respectable career for a life of danger with Carmen. \\n\\nBut she soon grows weary of Don José's possessiveness, longing to return to a life of independence. When Carmen turns her attention to the celebrated toreador Escamillo, Don José’s jealousy and despair threaten to violently erupt.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Carmen\",\"synopsis\":\"In a remote Spanish town, the free-spirited Carmen declares that any man she loves should beware. But even she is unprepared for what happens when she decides to seduce police officer Don José. Though initially uninterested in Carmen’s charms, Don José – against the wishes of his mother and of Micaëla, the woman who loves him – soon abandons his respectable career for a life of danger with Carmen. \\n\\nBut she soon grows weary of Don José's possessiveness, longing to return to a life of independence. When Carmen turns her attention to the celebrated toreador Escamillo, Don José’s jealousy and despair threaten to violently erupt.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Ginger Costa-Jackson\",\"Russell Thomas\"],\"direction\":[\"Damiano Michieletto\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":44},{\"id\":\"1000045315\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2026-27: Manon\",\"runtime\":11400,\"genres\":\"Ballet\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9e62c6d707c0eaedde8c4776e3e6725a.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"417415\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Nicholas\",\"lastName\":\"Georgiadis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2026-27: Manon\",\"synopsis\":\"In the seedy underbelly of 18th-century Paris, money is king. Nothing is sacred – even love itself can be bought for the right price. A native of this hedonistic underworld, Manon is caught between twin desires when she falls in love with the student Des Grieux. Steadfast and devoted, he offers the possibility of an honourable life – but the riches promised by the world of Parisian society remain tempting...\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/59/ff/59ffb8bcc466f2fca12e7157dfc8ee1a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9e62c6d707c0eaedde8c4776e3e6725a.jpeg\",\"synopsis\":\"In the seedy underbelly of 18th-century Paris, money is king. Nothing is sacred – even love itself can be bought for the right price. A native of this hedonistic underworld, Manon is caught between twin desires when she falls in love with the student Des Grieux. Steadfast and devoted, he offers the possibility of an honourable life. Yet, the riches promised by the world of Parisian society remain tempting...\\n\\nManon’s inner turmoil and struggle for survival lie at the devastating heart of Kenneth MacMillan’s 1974 adaptation of Abbé Prévost’s novel. In this signature work of The Royal Ballet, MacMillan’s nuanced understanding of human psychology makes for an unflinching look into the moral degradation of Manon’s Paris, while all its decadence and decay are brought to life through Jules Massenet’s score and Nicholas Georgiadis’s designs. \",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Manon\",\"synopsis\":\"In the seedy underbelly of 18th-century Paris, money is king. Nothing is sacred – even love itself can be bought for the right price. A native of this hedonistic underworld, Manon is caught between twin desires when she falls in love with the student Des Grieux. Steadfast and devoted, he offers the possibility of an honourable life. Yet, the riches promised by the world of Parisian society remain tempting...\\n\\nManon’s inner turmoil and struggle for survival lie at the devastating heart of Kenneth MacMillan’s 1974 adaptation of Abbé Prévost’s novel. In this signature work of The Royal Ballet, MacMillan’s nuanced understanding of human psychology makes for an unflinching look into the moral degradation of Manon’s Paris, while all its decadence and decay are brought to life through Jules Massenet’s score and Nicholas Georgiadis’s designs. \",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Nicholas Georgiadis\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":43},{\"id\":\"1000045314\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2026-27: Swan Lake\",\"runtime\":12300,\"genres\":\"Ballet\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/90d9ec84fd2e12db9fa40daa24ce7e0c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"417414\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Marius\",\"lastName\":\"Petipa\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Lev\",\"lastName\":\"Ivanov\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2026-27: Swan Lake\",\"synopsis\":\"Princess Odette is bound by a terrible curse: transformed into a swan by day by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken with a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and vows to free her. But Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers’ plans.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a9/45/a9454e97880a12c55d76e386ecec1904.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2027-04-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/90d9ec84fd2e12db9fa40daa24ce7e0c.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Princess Odette is bound by a terrible curse: transformed into a swan by day by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken with a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and vows to free her. But Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers’ plans.\\n\\nLiam Scarlett’s production for The Royal Ballet brings together Tchaikovsky’s towering score and John Macfarlane’s picturesque designs to create an enduring ballet spectacle of love, treachery and forgiveness.  \",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Swan Lake\",\"synopsis\":\"Princess Odette is bound by a terrible curse: transformed into a swan by day by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken with a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and vows to free her. But Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers’ plans.\\n\\nLiam Scarlett’s production for The Royal Ballet brings together Tchaikovsky’s towering score and John Macfarlane’s picturesque designs to create an enduring ballet spectacle of love, treachery and forgiveness.  \",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Marius Petipa\",\"Lev Ivanov\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2027-04-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":53},{\"id\":\"1000046229\",\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2026-27: The Nutcracker\",\"runtime\":10200,\"genres\":\"Ballet\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/027359690f2078b9943b08a4b68cd436.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"418519\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ac/e2/ace29e5ccdb431bc8d024369f798a25b.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Peter\",\"lastName\":\"Wright\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Julia\",\"lastName\":\"Trevelyan Oman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mayara\",\"lastName\":\"Magri\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Reece\",\"lastName\":\"Clarke\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"James\",\"lastName\":\"Hay\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"RBO Cinema Season 2026-27: The Nutcracker\",\"synopsis\":\"At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in search of her favourite gift. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys come alive and the magic never stops.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/8d/ff/8dff921a65f68039243632bd26b46d38.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-12-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/027359690f2078b9943b08a4b68cd436.jpeg\",\"synopsis\":\"At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys come alive and the magic never stops. \\n\\nPeter Wright’s production of this festive family favourite sparkles to the wondrous swell of Tchaikovsky’s orchestral score, alongside the glow and grandeur of Julia Trevelyan Oman’s period designs. \",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: The Nutcracker\",\"synopsis\":\"At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys come alive and the magic never stops. \\n\\nPeter Wright’s production of this festive family favourite sparkles to the wondrous swell of Tchaikovsky’s orchestral score, alongside the glow and grandeur of Julia Trevelyan Oman’s period designs. \",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Mayara Magri\",\"Reece Clarke\",\"James Hay\"],\"direction\":[\"Peter Wright\",\"Julia Trevelyan Oman\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-12-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":45},{\"id\":\"1000047228\",\"title\":\"Relaxed Screening: Minions & Monsters\",\"runtime\":5400,\"genres\":\"Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"419728\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7162e1c7404417544cf59d883452bf38.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Pierre\",\"lastName\":\"Coffin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Pierre\",\"lastName\":\"Coffin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christoph\",\"lastName\":\"Walz\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Amy\",\"lastName\":\"Sedaris\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Relaxed Screening: Minions & Monsters\",\"synopsis\":\"Fresh off the worldwide blockbuster success of summer 2024’s funniest comedy, Despicable Me 4, Illumination expands its joyful animated universe with a riotous new chapter, featuring all-new characters, in the biggest global animated franchise in history: Minions & Monsters. \\n\\nThis is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/95/7a/957a39ac4647ac4f5a89867224ddfef4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/a320af4cb7cbd66b9964c8e932e19cde.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"very mild comic violence, threat, rude humour\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/7162e1c7404417544cf59d883452bf38.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Welcome to Relaxed Screenings - a comfortable and inclusive way to enjoy the magic of the movies in a sensory and autism-friendly environment. Every month, we host a special screening with a reduced volume, dimmed lighting, and no ads or trailers, creating a calm and stress-free setting for neurodiverse guests, including those with autism and sensory sensitivities, and their friends, family, and carers.\\n\\nJoin us Sunday, 26 July, for a relaxed screening of Minions & Monsters - This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\\n\\nBBFC Content Warning - Minions & Monsters rating is U with very mild comic violence, threat, rude humour. Check the BBFC website for further information: https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/minions-monsters-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0xmteyote3\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Relaxed Screening: Minions & Monsters\",\"synopsis\":\"Welcome to Relaxed Screenings - a comfortable and inclusive way to enjoy the magic of the movies in a sensory and autism-friendly environment. Every month, we host a special screening with a reduced volume, dimmed lighting, and no ads or trailers, creating a calm and stress-free setting for neurodiverse guests, including those with autism and sensory sensitivities, and their friends, family, and carers.\\n\\nJoin us Sunday, 26 July, for a relaxed screening of Minions & Monsters - This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\\n\\nBBFC Content Warning - Minions & Monsters rating is U with very mild comic violence, threat, rude humour. Check the BBFC website for further information: https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/minions-monsters-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0xmteyote3\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Pierre Coffin\",\"Christoph Walz\",\"Amy Sedaris\"],\"direction\":[\"Pierre Coffin\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/a320af4cb7cbd66b9964c8e932e19cde.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-07-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"very mild comic violence, threat, rude humour\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":64},{\"id\":\"1000018854\",\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Science fiction, Horror, Thriller\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"385364\",\"395151\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/34729e2170e4524260e2beae942f8ea1.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/42/48/42482195534e602f91fc06074e6b842e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/76/f8/76f8ae759250735c722e45dca5761d01.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ee/42/ee421ff8ebc217d9263511d721c6d356.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b6/31/b63133b24b21c0a3b0c8d8fa333e8975.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a7/30/a73063f1a6a761912017daa11c37a4d6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9c/0c/9c0c8d277f2baf734f2da36552f6d708.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5b/1d/5b1d3cc54dcbee5118d59d5fa7b86771.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3c/2b/3c2b08ed6e96d4f15419015527b4ec05.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/06/5e/065eaeee888ed39f88f2a577a4f67690.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/28/ac/28ac0411a0758e1074b148692deff039.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Zach\",\"lastName\":\"Cregger\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Austin\",\"lastName\":\"Abrams\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Paul Walter\",\"lastName\":\"Hauser\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Zach\",\"lastName\":\"Cherry\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kali\",\"lastName\":\"Reis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Johnno\",\"lastName\":\"Wilson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"synopsis\":\"From the mind of visionary filmmaker Zach Cregger (Weapons, Barbarian) comes a thrilling — and terrifying — reinvention of the Resident Evil franchise. In an all-new story, Resident Evil follows Bryan (Austin Abrams), a medical courier who unwittingly finds himself in an action-packed, non-stop race for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/bb/43/bb43d69f09547650effc177ab0434157.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/385364_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/385364_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13762\",\"name\":\"Sony Pictures UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/34729e2170e4524260e2beae942f8ea1.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"From the mind of visionary filmmaker Zach Cregger (Weapons, Barbarian) comes a thrilling — and terrifying — reinvention of the Resident Evil franchise.\\n\\nIn an all-new story, Resident Evil follows Bryan (Austin Abrams), a medical courier who unwittingly finds himself in an action-packed, non-stop race for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1cf249caddaacaa14984f04ecc1bcdf5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Resident Evil\",\"synopsis\":\"From the mind of visionary filmmaker Zach Cregger (Weapons, Barbarian) comes a thrilling — and terrifying — reinvention of the Resident Evil franchise.\\n\\nIn an all-new story, Resident Evil follows Bryan (Austin Abrams), a medical courier who unwittingly finds himself in an action-packed, non-stop race for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Austin Abrams\",\"Paul Walter Hauser\",\"Zach Cherry\",\"Kali Reis\",\"Johnno Wilson\"],\"direction\":[\"Zach Cregger\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1cf249caddaacaa14984f04ecc1bcdf5.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/42/48/42482195534e602f91fc06074e6b842e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/76/f8/76f8ae759250735c722e45dca5761d01.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ee/42/ee421ff8ebc217d9263511d721c6d356.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b6/31/b63133b24b21c0a3b0c8d8fa333e8975.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a7/30/a73063f1a6a761912017daa11c37a4d6.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9c/0c/9c0c8d277f2baf734f2da36552f6d708.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5b/1d/5b1d3cc54dcbee5118d59d5fa7b86771.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3c/2b/3c2b08ed6e96d4f15419015527b4ec05.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/06/5e/065eaeee888ed39f88f2a577a4f67690.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/28/ac/28ac0411a0758e1074b148692deff039.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1cf249caddaacaa14984f04ecc1bcdf5.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/385364_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/385364_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Sony Pictures UK\"}},{\"id\":\"1000013229\",\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland\",\"runtime\":10200,\"genres\":\"Ballet\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"377468\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/65838e3b99aa35259cbbe32da0e6432a.jpeg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Wheeldon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marcelino\",\"lastName\":\"Sambé\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"William\",\"lastName\":\"Bracewell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Matthew\",\"lastName\":\"Ball\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Francesca\",\"lastName\":\"Hayward\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland\",\"synopsis\":\"At a garden party on a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents’ friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream? Christopher Wheeldon’s Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in an explosion of colour, stage magic and inventive, sophisticated choreography. Joby Talbot’s score combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the 19th century. Bob Crowley’s wildly imaginative, eye-popping designs draw on everything from puppetry to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The Royal Ballet at its best, bringing together world-class dance with enchanting family entertainment and ingenious music and design.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e5/f9/e5f92bf27b5b6d0fab1261f83fd55c42.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2027-03-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/65838e3b99aa35259cbbe32da0e6432a.jpeg\",\"synopsis\":\"At a garden party on a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents’ friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream? \\n\\nChristopher Wheeldon’s Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in an explosion of colour, stage magic and inventive, sophisticated choreography. Joby Talbot’s score combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the 19th century. Bob Crowley’s wildly imaginative, eye-popping designs draw on everything from puppetry to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The Royal Ballet at its best, bringing together world-class dance with enchanting family entertainment and ingenious music and design. \",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Alice's Adventures in Wonderland\",\"synopsis\":\"At a garden party on a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents’ friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream? \\n\\nChristopher Wheeldon’s Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in an explosion of colour, stage magic and inventive, sophisticated choreography. Joby Talbot’s score combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the 19th century. Bob Crowley’s wildly imaginative, eye-popping designs draw on everything from puppetry to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The Royal Ballet at its best, bringing together world-class dance with enchanting family entertainment and ingenious music and design. \",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Marcelino Sambé\",\"William Bracewell\",\"Matthew Ball\",\"Francesca Hayward\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Wheeldon\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2027-03-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":51},{\"id\":\"1000045318\",\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Così fan tutte\",\"runtime\":12600,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/0cf04756d7bd51712f27023abcc8a222.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"417418\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Netia\",\"lastName\":\"Jones\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Così fan tutte\",\"synopsis\":\"Spurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/43/04/43042daafaaf616b7eb6c998fb79859f.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2027-02-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/0cf04756d7bd51712f27023abcc8a222.jpeg\",\"synopsis\":\"Spurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable. \\n\\nCosì fan tutte has lost none of its sting since it first scandalised audiences in 1790. In her Main Stage debut, Netia Jones, Associate Director of The Royal Opera, reimagines Mozart’s comedy of manners through a sharp contemporary lens, where 18th-century romantic trickery meets deeply satirical high-tech deceit. Taking on the roles of the lovers is an exciting young cast led by Louise Alder, Simone McIntosh, Mingjie Lei and Huw Montague Rendall, with Gerald Finley as their manipulative game-master Don Alfonso and Emily Pogorelc as Despina. Thomas Hengelbrock conducts, bringing out the exquisite melodies that underpin the provocative and resolutely modern themes at the heart of the opera. \",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Così fan tutte\",\"synopsis\":\"Spurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable. \\n\\nCosì fan tutte has lost none of its sting since it first scandalised audiences in 1790. In her Main Stage debut, Netia Jones, Associate Director of The Royal Opera, reimagines Mozart’s comedy of manners through a sharp contemporary lens, where 18th-century romantic trickery meets deeply satirical high-tech deceit. Taking on the roles of the lovers is an exciting young cast led by Louise Alder, Simone McIntosh, Mingjie Lei and Huw Montague Rendall, with Gerald Finley as their manipulative game-master Don Alfonso and Emily Pogorelc as Despina. Thomas Hengelbrock conducts, bringing out the exquisite melodies that underpin the provocative and resolutely modern themes at the heart of the opera. \",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Netia Jones\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2027-02-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":49},{\"id\":\"1000045317\",\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Götterdämmerung\",\"runtime\":21000,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fbb2c242592b23621fd7db72556550f8.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"417417\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Barrie\",\"lastName\":\"Kosky\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Götterdämmerung\",\"synopsis\":\"Deception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Brünnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved’s innocence, Brünnhilde at last returns the ring to the Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames. Impassioned, otherworldly music – including Siegfried’s transporting Funeral March and Brünnhilde’s electrifying Immolation Scene – pairs with unmatched drama in the all-consuming conclusion of Wagner’s unforgettable saga.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/29/46/2946a5df7babe00d9ca1b7f01359b7b9.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2027-02-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fbb2c242592b23621fd7db72556550f8.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"An earth in ruin. The twilight of the Gods. \\n\\nDeception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Brünnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved’s innocence, Brünnhilde at last returns the ring to the Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames. For the long-awaited finale of Wagner’s epic saga, director Barrie Kosky situates the rich apocalyptic drama in a contemporary world of dream-like turmoil. Antonio Pappano, Conductor Laureate of The Royal Opera, returns to take on the impassioned, otherworldly music – including Siegfried’s transporting Funeral March and Brünnhilde’s electrifying Immolation Scene. The brilliant cast is led by Elisabet Strid, Andreas Schager and Mika Kares, who together with the full forces of the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House and the Royal Opera Chorus bring opera’s greatest journey to its shattering end. \",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Götterdämmerung\",\"synopsis\":\"An earth in ruin. The twilight of the Gods. \\n\\nDeception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Brünnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved’s innocence, Brünnhilde at last returns the ring to the Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames. For the long-awaited finale of Wagner’s epic saga, director Barrie Kosky situates the rich apocalyptic drama in a contemporary world of dream-like turmoil. Antonio Pappano, Conductor Laureate of The Royal Opera, returns to take on the impassioned, otherworldly music – including Siegfried’s transporting Funeral March and Brünnhilde’s electrifying Immolation Scene. The brilliant cast is led by Elisabet Strid, Andreas Schager and Mika Kares, who together with the full forces of the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House and the Royal Opera Chorus bring opera’s greatest journey to its shattering end. \",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Barrie Kosky\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2027-02-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":48},{\"id\":\"1000046230\",\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Romeo and Juliet\",\"runtime\":10200,\"genres\":\"Ballet\",\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0b/26/0b2607691b5d4d3bdc45837857ce68d3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"418520\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b7/03/b703e55a7596f9924f7893e257f6a813.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Kenneth\",\"lastName\":\"MacMillan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Fumi\",\"lastName\":\"Kaneko\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Vadim\",\"lastName\":\"Muntagirov\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Francisco\",\"lastName\":\"Serrano\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Romeo and Juliet\",\"synopsis\":\"The Capulets and Montagues are sworn enemies. Yet it is love at first sight for Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet when they meet each other at the Capulet ball, into which Romeo has snuck. The two fall in love and they profess their devotion to each other at Juliet’s balcony. They secretly get married.\\n\\nThe stakes are raised for the young couple when Romeo avenges the death of his friend Mercutio who has been killed by Tybalt, Juliet’s cousin. For this, Romeo is exiled from Verona. Meanwhile, Juliet’s parents are forcing her to marry another suitor. In order to be together, Romeo and Juliet must risk it all.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0b/26/0b2607691b5d4d3bdc45837857ce68d3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2027-05-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":null,\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Romeo and Juliet\",\"synopsis\":\"The Capulets and Montagues are sworn enemies. Yet it is love at first sight for Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet when they meet each other at the Capulet ball, into which Romeo has snuck. The two fall in love and they profess their devotion to each other at Juliet’s balcony. They secretly get married.\\n\\nThe stakes are raised for the young couple when Romeo avenges the death of his friend Mercutio who has been killed by Tybalt, Juliet’s cousin. For this, Romeo is exiled from Verona. Meanwhile, Juliet’s parents are forcing her to marry another suitor. In order to be together, Romeo and Juliet must risk it all.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Fumi Kaneko\",\"Vadim Muntagirov\",\"Francisco Serrano\"],\"direction\":[\"Kenneth MacMillan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2027-05-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":56},{\"id\":\"1000046138\",\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Tosca\",\"runtime\":11700,\"genres\":\"Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/c59de944151cf963a344db8030109fa1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"418415\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Oliver\",\"lastName\":\"Mears\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Aleksandra\",\"lastName\":\"Kurzak\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Saimir\",\"lastName\":\"Pirgu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Maltman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Tosca\",\"synopsis\":\"Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out? Oliver Mears’s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini’s operatic thriller in a contemporary, war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5b/f3/5bf3174d5778afcc676a162e0cc0c033.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2027-05-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"39223\",\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/c59de944151cf963a344db8030109fa1.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?\\n\\nOliver Mears’s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini’s operatic thriller in a contemporary, war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera: Tosca\",\"synopsis\":\"Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?\\n\\nOliver Mears’s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini’s operatic thriller in a contemporary, war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Aleksandra Kurzak\",\"Saimir Pirgu\",\"Christopher Maltman\"],\"direction\":[\"Oliver Mears\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2027-05-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"},\"orderIndex\":55},{\"id\":\"326991\",\"title\":\"Savage House\",\"runtime\":6840,\"genres\":\"Historical, Comedy\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9b6ebfec0a33846333fac9c547a5ab07.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"411474\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/13/07/1307c999f172a04d01324b917c2e6813.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b1/ae/b1ae18647d911f99fe51f36efe91bb37.jpg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Peter\",\"lastName\":\"Glanz\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Richard E.\",\"lastName\":\"Grant\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Claire\",\"lastName\":\"Foy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sebastian\",\"lastName\":\"Armesto\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Roger\",\"lastName\":\"Ashton-Griffiths\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Bel\",\"lastName\":\"Powley\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jack\",\"lastName\":\"Farthing\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kíla\",\"lastName\":\"Lord Cassidy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Richard\",\"lastName\":\"McCabe\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Vicki\",\"lastName\":\"Pepperdine\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Pip\",\"lastName\":\"Torrens\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Savage House\",\"synopsis\":\"Set against the backdrop of 18th century England, a massive Pox outbreak, and Jacobite Uprising - this is a timely and darkly satirical story of Sir Chauncey Savage (Grant) and Lady Savage’s (Foy) blind pursuit of a better life. It is not without a tinge of irony that their family name is the Savages, for this is a Savage House indeed. Filled with duels, decadence, and bloodshed, this is a madcap play on class and power.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c4/63/c463cbba9b19b96208588856e7ed2705.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/411474_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/411474_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/5a6da56bec031965375ce294e854d9b2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13760\",\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex, injury detail, violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9b6ebfec0a33846333fac9c547a5ab07.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/b5f0751ee64ac1347bd3ff8d077cdc7e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Savage House\",\"synopsis\":\"Set against the backdrop of 18th century England, a massive Pox outbreak, and Jacobite Uprising - this is a timely and darkly satirical story of Sir Chauncey Savage (Grant) and Lady Savage’s (Foy) blind pursuit of a better life. It is not without a tinge of irony that their family name is the Savages, for this is a Savage House indeed. Filled with duels, decadence, and bloodshed, this is a madcap play on class and power.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Richard E. Grant\",\"Claire Foy\",\"Sebastian Armesto\",\"Roger Ashton-Griffiths\",\"Bel Powley\",\"Jack Farthing\",\"Kíla Lord Cassidy\",\"Richard McCabe\",\"Vicki Pepperdine\",\"Pip Torrens\"],\"direction\":[\"Peter Glanz\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/b5f0751ee64ac1347bd3ff8d077cdc7e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/13/07/1307c999f172a04d01324b917c2e6813.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/b5f0751ee64ac1347bd3ff8d077cdc7e.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/5a6da56bec031965375ce294e854d9b2.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex, injury detail, violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/411474_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/411474_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\"}},{\"id\":\"1000026622\",\"title\":\"Sense and Sensibility\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Drama, Romance, Historical\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"395156\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fc1ce1a6844756f2f930c3535bf38036.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/95/ef/95ef5571a75f0a3b926f5126d9c8571c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ec/9a/ec9a9a11a8214065016d15e5fe93176c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2c/4a/2c4a7555b9fefd7df491a8a8dfbffb6f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https:/