nes\",\"Esmé Creed-Miles\",\"Caitriona Balfe\",\"Frank Dillane\",\"Herbert Nordrum\",\"Bodhi Rae Breathnach\",\"George MacKay\",\"Fiona Shaw\",\"Chloe Pirrie\",\"Forrest Bothwell\"],\"direction\":[\"Georgia Oakley\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/95/ef/95ef5571a75f0a3b926f5126d9c8571c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ec/9a/ec9a9a11a8214065016d15e5fe93176c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2c/4a/2c4a7555b9fefd7df491a8a8dfbffb6f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d7/c0/d7c00790667a5d5144e8a1c1678ca89a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6d/aa/6daac24005ca76c61c411121b7d37d82.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6c/7d/6c7dbc098c1abde49441c719950e2fb5.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/395156_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/395156_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\"}},{\"id\":\"227363\",\"title\":\"Shrek 5\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Fantasy\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2bf78faa18853e82f42ca2be4ef13e14.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"358797\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4a/b3/4ab391ea1bb262f9954193dbc8688ab1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c8/9b/c89b6b45a4dcdbf5cb79a0360e1f1085.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f0/c1/f0c1a4c208650dcc0ebcbd20b87a3635.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Walt\",\"lastName\":\"Dohrn\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Brad\",\"lastName\":\"Ableson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Shrek 5\",\"synopsis\":null,\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/358797_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/358797_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2027-06-30T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13733\",\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mike\",\"lastName\":\"Myers\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cameron\",\"lastName\":\"Diaz\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Eddie\",\"lastName\":\"Murphy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":null,\"lastName\":\"Zendaya\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marcello\",\"lastName\":\"Hernández\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Skyler\",\"lastName\":\"Gisondo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Chris\",\"lastName\":\"Miller (VII)\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cody\",\"lastName\":\"Cameron\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Conrad\",\"lastName\":\"Vernon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2bf78faa18853e82f42ca2be4ef13e14.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Next summer, DreamWorks Animation invites audiences on a thrilling, magical new comedy adventure from one of the most beloved global animated franchises of all time: Shrek 5.\\n\\nComedy legends Mike Myers, Oscar® nominee Eddie Murphy and Cameron Diaz return to their signature roles as Shrek, Donkey and Fiona. Emmy winning superstar Zendaya (The Odyssey, Dune franchise) joins the cast as Shrek and Fiona’s daughter Felicia, along with Marcello Hernandez (Saturday Night Live, Happy Gilmore 2) and Skyler Gisondo (Superman, Booksmart) as Felicia’s brothers, Fergus and Farkle.\\n\\nShrek 5 is directed by acclaimed filmmakers and Shrek franchise veterans Conrad Vernon and Walt Dohrn. Vernon was a member of the directing team on the Academy Award® nominated Shrek 2 as well as on DreamWorks Animation’s Madagascar 3: Europe’s Most Wanted and Monsters vs. Aliens. Vernon has also provided the voice of Shrek fan-favourite Gingerbread Man, aka “Gingy,” across all titles in the Shrek Universe. Dohrn worked on the second and third Shrek films as a writer and artist and as Head of Story on the fourth film. Dohrn also voiced the character of Rumpelstiltskin in Shrek Forever After. Dohrn served as co-director on the first Trolls film and directed Trolls World Tour and Trolls Band Together.\\n\\nThe film is produced by returning producer Gina Shay (Trolls franchise), who produced Shrek Forever After and by Illumination CEO and Academy Award® nominee Chris Meledandri (the Super Mario, Despicable Me and Minions franchises). The film is co-directed by Brad Ableson (Minions: The Rise of Gru, The Simpsons).\\n\\nFor the past two decades, audiences have been enchanted by the delightful, irreverent adventures of a misunderstood ogre and his ragtag group of roguish fairytale folk, based on the book by acclaimed author William Steig. Beginning in 2001 with Shrek, the winner of the first ever Academy Award® for Best Animated Feature, Shrek, Donkey and Fiona (along with their friends, family and tormentors), have grown into an indelible part of pop culture, reminding audiences around the globe that beauty is in the eye of the beholder.\\n\\nThe four Shrek films have earned more than $2.9 billion worldwide, spawning a global live-touring show, an award-winning Broadway musical that earned eight Tony nominations and 12 Drama Desk nominations, plus an immersive, top-tourist destination in London and popular events and attractions across Universal Destinations & Experiences’ theme parks.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/68724bdf130bb6b2ac9bdeaea18fcea7.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Shrek 5\",\"synopsis\":\"Next summer, DreamWorks Animation invites audiences on a thrilling, magical new comedy adventure from one of the most beloved global animated franchises of all time: Shrek 5.\\n\\nComedy legends Mike Myers, Oscar® nominee Eddie Murphy and Cameron Diaz return to their signature roles as Shrek, Donkey and Fiona. Emmy winning superstar Zendaya (The Odyssey, Dune franchise) joins the cast as Shrek and Fiona’s daughter Felicia, along with Marcello Hernandez (Saturday Night Live, Happy Gilmore 2) and Skyler Gisondo (Superman, Booksmart) as Felicia’s brothers, Fergus and Farkle.\\n\\nShrek 5 is directed by acclaimed filmmakers and Shrek franchise veterans Conrad Vernon and Walt Dohrn. Vernon was a member of the directing team on the Academy Award® nominated Shrek 2 as well as on DreamWorks Animation’s Madagascar 3: Europe’s Most Wanted and Monsters vs. Aliens. Vernon has also provided the voice of Shrek fan-favourite Gingerbread Man, aka “Gingy,” across all titles in the Shrek Universe. Dohrn worked on the second and third Shrek films as a writer and artist and as Head of Story on the fourth film. Dohrn also voiced the character of Rumpelstiltskin in Shrek Forever After. Dohrn served as co-director on the first Trolls film and directed Trolls World Tour and Trolls Band Together.\\n\\nThe film is produced by returning producer Gina Shay (Trolls franchise), who produced Shrek Forever After and by Illumination CEO and Academy Award® nominee Chris Meledandri (the Super Mario, Despicable Me and Minions franchises). The film is co-directed by Brad Ableson (Minions: The Rise of Gru, The Simpsons).\\n\\nFor the past two decades, audiences have been enchanted by the delightful, irreverent adventures of a misunderstood ogre and his ragtag group of roguish fairytale folk, based on the book by acclaimed author William Steig. Beginning in 2001 with Shrek, the winner of the first ever Academy Award® for Best Animated Feature, Shrek, Donkey and Fiona (along with their friends, family and tormentors), have grown into an indelible part of pop culture, reminding audiences around the globe that beauty is in the eye of the beholder.\\n\\nThe four Shrek films have earned more than $2.9 billion worldwide, spawning a global live-touring show, an award-winning Broadway musical that earned eight Tony nominations and 12 Drama Desk nominations, plus an immersive, top-tourist destination in London and popular events and attractions across Universal Destinations & Experiences’ theme parks.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Mike Myers\",\"Cameron Diaz\",\"Eddie Murphy\",\"Zendaya\",\"Marcello Hernández\",\"Skyler Gisondo\",\"Chris Miller (VII)\",\"Cody Cameron\",\"Conrad Vernon\"],\"direction\":[\"Walt Dohrn\",\"Brad Ableson\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/68724bdf130bb6b2ac9bdeaea18fcea7.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4a/b3/4ab391ea1bb262f9954193dbc8688ab1.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c8/9b/c89b6b45a4dcdbf5cb79a0360e1f1085.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f0/c1/f0c1a4c208650dcc0ebcbd20b87a3635.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/68724bdf130bb6b2ac9bdeaea18fcea7.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2027-06-30T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/358797_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/358797_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\"}},{\"id\":\"276608\",\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"runtime\":8700,\"genres\":\"Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science fiction\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"374538\",\"409515\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ad90d3d8cba1e65798da962f57382d49.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d1/a5/d1a5b42cbd13d3423a97003cf5454564.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c6/4f/c64fed0aa63d9d22b15b7468c452442d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/08/b8/08b809df33bab0a397aaab2306f7c974.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f7/f4/f7f48be830a2c31f9748e5c3189e5196.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d2/f6/d2f61e27ba1818d91c6799bfd4f1a5df.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/12/55/1255d9c489aea007d3b4054e556a0d90.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Destin Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Cretton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tom\",\"lastName\":\"Holland\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":null,\"lastName\":\"Zendaya\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sadie\",\"lastName\":\"Sink\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jacob\",\"lastName\":\"Batalon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jon\",\"lastName\":\"Bernthal\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tramell\",\"lastName\":\"Tillman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michael\",\"lastName\":\"Mando\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mark\",\"lastName\":\"Ruffalo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Liza\",\"lastName\":\"Colon-Zayas\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marvin \\\"Krondon\\\"\",\"lastName\":\"Jones III\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"synopsis\":\"After the record-breaking global success of Spider-Man: No Way Home, Spider-Man: Brand New Day marks an entirely new chapter for Peter Parker and Spider-Man. Four years have passed since the events of No Way Home, and Peter is now an adult living entirely alone, having voluntarily erased himself from the lives and memories of those he loves. Crime-fighting in a New York that no longer knows his name, he's devoted himself entirely to protecting his city - a full-time Spider-Man - but as the demands on him intensify, the pressure sparks a surprising physical evolution that threatens his existence, even as a strange new pattern of crimes gives rise to one of the most powerful threats he has ever faced.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/7c/02/7c023a47a68cb4d75e48dcb245601cca.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/374538_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/374538_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/e0375454b6231e2e331bd38e64352c32.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13762\",\"name\":\"Sony Pictures UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ad90d3d8cba1e65798da962f57382d49.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day marks an entirely new chapter for Peter Parker and Spider-Man. Four years have passed since the events of No Way Home, and Peter is now an adult living entirely alone, having voluntarily erased himself from the lives and memories of those he loves. Crime-fighting in a New York that no longer knows his name, he’s devoted himself entirely to protecting his city — a full-time Spider-Man — but as the demands on him intensify, the pressure sparks a surprising physical evolution that threatens his existence, even as a strange new pattern of crimes gives rise to one of the most powerful threats he has ever faced.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"synopsis\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day marks an entirely new chapter for Peter Parker and Spider-Man. Four years have passed since the events of No Way Home, and Peter is now an adult living entirely alone, having voluntarily erased himself from the lives and memories of those he loves. Crime-fighting in a New York that no longer knows his name, he’s devoted himself entirely to protecting his city — a full-time Spider-Man — but as the demands on him intensify, the pressure sparks a surprising physical evolution that threatens his existence, even as a strange new pattern of crimes gives rise to one of the most powerful threats he has ever faced.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Tom Holland\",\"Zendaya\",\"Sadie Sink\",\"Jacob Batalon\",\"Jon Bernthal\",\"Tramell Tillman\",\"Michael Mando\",\"Mark Ruffalo\",\"Liza Colon-Zayas\",\"Marvin \\\"Krondon\\\" Jones III\"],\"direction\":[\"Destin Daniel Cretton\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d1/a5/d1a5b42cbd13d3423a97003cf5454564.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c6/4f/c64fed0aa63d9d22b15b7468c452442d.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/08/b8/08b809df33bab0a397aaab2306f7c974.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f7/f4/f7f48be830a2c31f9748e5c3189e5196.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d2/f6/d2f61e27ba1818d91c6799bfd4f1a5df.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/12/55/1255d9c489aea007d3b4054e556a0d90.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/e0375454b6231e2e331bd38e64352c32.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/374538_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/374538_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Sony Pictures UK\"},\"orderIndex\":28},{\"id\":\"325481\",\"title\":\"Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu\",\"runtime\":7920,\"genres\":\"Science fiction, Fantasy, Adventure, Action\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"355986\",\"400301\",\"409507\",\"409508\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/82865e0e8f93a39ae1265d80dcf23f00.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/pictures/24/01/10/09/38/0935930.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c0/54/c0549c3531eb58b3edc5caf5d20fc7cd.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/8b/14/8b14a85abe613304784b076b0aaac940.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/43/b0/43b0648ff321f7a8d33cf615f109c0be.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/7a/7f/7a7f113988b1d38c732797ab01334030.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3b/58/3b58fcc339e939e77faabc2bc420c6f7.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a0/99/a0991c3fa4004461f9f53429e4c59149.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/93/a6/93a63c1f4875b7f07890374b9e98a83c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5c/a0/5ca0b86d1db907ca0f4a2d58f4a65188.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/06/c6/06c670e7ab3b409ab2b03713551cabb8.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jon\",\"lastName\":\"Favreau\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"The Mandalorian and Grogu\",\"synopsis\":\"The Mandalorian and Grogu embark on their most thrilling mission yet in Lucasfilm’s “Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu,” an all-new Star Wars adventure opening exclusively in theaters May 22, 2026. The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin (Pedro Pascal) and his young apprentice Grogu.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/37/d7/37d702c74283a23869388d1d3ddd3c9f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/1e62e2a3a53d5c5e594de05615005d2a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-05-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"moderate violence, threat, injury detail\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Pedro\",\"lastName\":\"Pascal\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sigourney\",\"lastName\":\"Weaver\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jeremy\",\"lastName\":\"Allen White\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jonny\",\"lastName\":\"Coyne\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dave\",\"lastName\":\"Filoni\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Steve\",\"lastName\":\"Blum\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Martin\",\"lastName\":\"Scorsese\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Paul\",\"lastName\":\"Sun-Hyung Lee\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Matthew\",\"lastName\":\"Willig\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Hemky\",\"lastName\":\"Madera\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/82865e0e8f93a39ae1265d80dcf23f00.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"The Mandalorian and Grogu embark on their most thrilling mission yet in Lucasfilm’s “Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu,” an all-new Star Wars adventure.\\n\\nFollowing the fall of the evil Galactic Empire, Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin (Pedro Pascal) and his young apprentice Grogu. Attempting to rescue Rotta the Hutt in exchange for information from the Hutt clan on a New Republic target.\\n\\nDirected by Jon Favreau, “Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu” also stars Sigourney Weaver, Martin Scorsese, Jeremy Allen White, Steve Blum and more.\\n\\nPlease note that STAR WARS: THE MANDALORIAN AND GROGU contains several sequences with flashing lights that may affect those who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or have other photosensitivities.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/8c537ba7a5430487b0622d3e14e284a1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu\",\"synopsis\":\"The Mandalorian and Grogu embark on their most thrilling mission yet in Lucasfilm’s “Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu,” an all-new Star Wars adventure.\\n\\nFollowing the fall of the evil Galactic Empire, Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin (Pedro Pascal) and his young apprentice Grogu. Attempting to rescue Rotta the Hutt in exchange for information from the Hutt clan on a New Republic target.\\n\\nDirected by Jon Favreau, “Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu” also stars Sigourney Weaver, Martin Scorsese, Jeremy Allen White, Steve Blum and more.\\n\\nPlease note that STAR WARS: THE MANDALORIAN AND GROGU contains several sequences with flashing lights that may affect those who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or have other photosensitivities.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Pedro Pascal\",\"Sigourney Weaver\",\"Jeremy Allen White\",\"Jonny Coyne\",\"Dave Filoni\",\"Steve Blum\",\"Martin Scorsese\",\"Paul Sun-Hyung Lee\",\"Matthew Willig\",\"Hemky Madera\"],\"direction\":[\"Jon Favreau\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"