yptic world until a mysterious radio transmission spurs Hig to venture into the unknown in search of the hope and humanity he still believes exists.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f9/30/f930b62c41eb73b8178d61fe4d0f2f03.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/379897_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/379897_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/909918e84bd489581491776646904ff1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-08-28T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/c833a0bfd8a51ed575af164642c9d25b.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Survivors of a deadly pandemic traverse a post-apocalyptic landscape to find the origin of a mysterious radio transmission.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/58ba460a2f0f02aaaef9e070d2c6af0c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Dog Stars\",\"synopsis\":\"Survivors of a deadly pandemic traverse a post-apocalyptic landscape to find the origin of a mysterious radio transmission.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Jacob Elordi\",\"Margaret Qualley\",\"Josh Brolin\",\"Guy Pearce\",\"Benedict Wong\",\"Allison Janney\",\"Alara-Star Khan\",\"Sebastian Rokison-Woodall\"],\"direction\":[\"Ridley Scott\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pi