ion in human history: travelling beyond this galaxy to discover whether mankind has a future among the stars.\\n\\nScreening on Sundays and Wednesdays as part of our Throwback Season, where we revisit classics. Each ticket to these showtimes includes complimentary popcorn and a drink.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a21968d2256f5ed7e40db630c6dce42a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Throwback: Interstellar\",\"synopsis\":\"With our time on Earth coming to an end, a team of explorers undertakes the most important mission in human history: travelling beyond this galaxy to discover whether mankind has a future among the stars.\\n\\nScreening on Sundays and Wednesdays as part of our Throwback Season, where we revisit classics. Each ticket to these showtimes includes complimentary popcorn and a drink.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Matthew McConaughey\",\"Anne Hathaway\",\"Jessica Chastain\",\"Ellen Burstyn\",\"John Lithgow\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Nolan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a21968d2256f5ed7e40db630c6dce42a.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a21968d2256f5ed7e40db630c6dce42a.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2024-03-24T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate threat, violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"}},{\"id\":\"1000044933\",\"title\":\"Throwback: The Dark Knight\",\"runtime\":9120,\"genres\":\"Action, Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9b7547e47d10d10af18235a6eae37df1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"416970\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Nolan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christian\",\"lastName\":\"Bale\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Heath\",\"lastName\":\"Ledger\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Aaron\",\"lastName\":\"Eckhart\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Nolan Throwback: The Dark Knight\",\"synopsis\":\"With the help of Lieutenant Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to destroy organized crime in Gotham for good. The triumvirate proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a rising criminal mastermind known as the Joker, who thrusts Gotham into anarchy and forces the Dark Knight ever closer to crossing the fine line between hero and vigilante.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ac/16/ac1697bb04851c673da02f1f1814d014.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-06-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains strong fantasy violence and sustained threat\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Throwback: The Dark Knight\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9b7547e47d10d10af18235a6eae37df1.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"With the help of Lieutenant Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to destroy organised crime in Gotham for good. The triumvirate proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a rising criminal mastermind known as the Joker, who thrusts Gotham into anarchy and forces the Dark Knight ever closer to crossing the fine line between hero and vigilante.\\n\\nScreening on Sundays and Wednesdays as part of our Nolan Throwback Season, where we revisit classics. Each ticket to these showtimes includes complimentary popcorn and a drink.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Nolan Throwback: The Dark Knight\",\"synopsis\":\"With the help of Lieutenant Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to destroy organised crime in Gotham for good. The triumvirate proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a rising criminal mastermind known as the Joker, who thrusts Gotham into anarchy and forces the Dark Knight ever closer to crossing the fine line between hero and vigilante.\\n\\nScreening on Sundays and Wednesdays as part of our Nolan Throwback Season, where we revisit classics. Each ticket to these showtimes includes complimentary popcorn and a drink.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Christian Bale\",\"Heath Ledger\",\"Aaron Eckhart\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Nolan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-06-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"Contains strong fantasy violence and sustained threat\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"1000044934\",\"title\":\"Throwback: The Dark Knight Rises\",\"runtime\":9840,\"genres\":\"Action, Thriller\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/15da832b7c781a16060cdd0b3c58f005.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"416971\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Nolan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christian\",\"lastName\":\"Bale\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Gary\",\"lastName\":\"Oldman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tom\",\"lastName\":\"Hardy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Nolan Throwback: The Dark Knight Rises\",\"synopsis\":\"After eight years of struggling with his new status as a wanted vigilante, Batman must contend with newcomers Catwoman and the brutal and villainous Bane.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/58/69/58699d7739457fc570aa891eb74ea530.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-06-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Throwback: The Dark Knight Rises\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/15da832b7c781a16060cdd0b3c58f005.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Despite his tarnished reputation after the events of The Dark Knight (2008), in which he took the rap for Dent's crimes, Batman feels compelled to intervene to assist the city and its Police force, which is struggling to cope with Bane's plans to destroy the city.\\n\\nScreening on Sundays and Wednesdays as part of our Nolan Throwback Season, where we revisit classics. Each ticket to these showtimes includes complimentary popcorn and a drink.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Nolan Throwback: The Dark Knight Rises\",\"synopsis\":\"Despite his tarnished reputation after the events of The Dark Knight (2008), in which he took the rap for Dent's crimes, Batman feels compelled to intervene to assist the city and its Police force, which is struggling to cope with Bane's plans to destroy the city.\\n\\nScreening on Sundays and Wednesdays as part of our Nolan Throwback Season, where we revisit classics. Each ticket to these showtimes includes complimentary popcorn and a drink.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Christian Bale\",\"Gary Oldman\",\"Tom Hardy\"],\"direction\":[\"Christopher Nolan\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-06-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"1000047224\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Beauty and the Beast (1991)\",\"runtime\":5220,\"genres\":\"Animation, Fantasy, Romance, Musical\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"419724\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/abc60cfce2cedf3c3fd24b0f8f2ef4b1.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Gary\",\"lastName\":\"Trousdale\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Robby\",\"lastName\":\"Benson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Paige\",\"lastName\":\"O'Hara\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Richard\",\"lastName\":\"White\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Beauty and the Beast (1991)\",\"synopsis\":\"An arrogant nobleman is turned into a beast and, in order to break the spell, he tries to win the love of a village girl.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9d/6a/9d6a6ce2cdbf7dd29090dddb764cf792.webp\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-31T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains mild violence and threat\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/abc60cfce2cedf3c3fd24b0f8f2ef4b1.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"In 18th-century France, an arrogant prince is cursed by an enchantress to live as a hideous Beast. To break the spell, he must earn the love of a spirited village girl named Belle before the enchanted rose loses all its petals. Belle takes her father's place as the Beast's prisoner, eventually uncovering his kind heart.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: Beauty and the Beast (1991)\",\"synopsis\":\"In 18th-century France, an arrogant prince is cursed by an enchantress to live as a hideous Beast. To break the spell, he must earn the love of a spirited village girl named Belle before the enchanted rose loses all its petals. Belle takes her father's place as the Beast's prisoner, eventually uncovering his kind heart.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Robby Benson\",\"Paige O'Hara\",\"Richard White\"],\"direction\":[\"Gary Trousdale\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-07-31T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"Contains mild violence and threat\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":70},{\"id\":\"324792\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Kung Fu Panda\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Animation, Action, Adventure, Family\",\"poster\":\"https://fr.web.img5.acsta.net/f_jpg/r_600_10000/medias/nmedia/18/36/20/29/18864516.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"355341\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Mark\",\"lastName\":\"Osborne\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jack\",\"lastName\":\"Black\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dustin\",\"lastName\":\"Hoffman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Angelina\",\"lastName\":\"Jolie\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Kung Fu Panda\",\"synopsis\":\"\",\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2024-01-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13760\",\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://fr.web.img5.acsta.net/f_jpg/r_600_10000/medias/nmedia/18/36/20/29/18864516.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"When Po the Panda, a kung fu enthusiast, gets selected as the Dragon Warrior, he decides to team up with the Furious Five and destroy the evil forces that threaten the Valley of Peace.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d6af4f9d4fd74e5eeab5679568b48abf.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: Kung Fu Panda\",\"synopsis\":\"When Po the Panda, a kung fu enthusiast, gets selected as the Dragon Warrior, he decides to team up with the Furious Five and destroy the evil forces that threaten the Valley of Peace.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Jack Black\",\"Dustin Hoffman\",\"Angelina Jolie\"],\"direction\":[\"Mark Osborne\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d6af4f9d4fd74e5eeab5679568b48abf.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d6af4f9d4fd74e5eeab5679568b48abf.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2024-01-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\"},\"orderIndex\":68},{\"id\":\"1000045657\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Madagascar\",\"runtime\":5160,\"genres\":\"Animation, Comedy, Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e1e943436940d872c9f90ab98b550906.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"417832\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Eric\",\"lastName\":\"Darnell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ben\",\"lastName\":\"Stiller\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Chris\",\"lastName\":\"Rock\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"David\",\"lastName\":\"Schwimmer\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jada\",\"lastName\":\"Pinkett Smith\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Madagascar\",\"synopsis\":\"Four zoo animals are shipped back to their homeland by an animal rights group that feels they belong in the wild. When the ship capsizes, the animals find themselves stranded in Madagascar. Having had humans care for them their entire life, they know nothing about survival and must work together with the locals to help them fit in.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/93/c0/93c0209442ac06ef16d661ee47d74d95.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains very mild language and violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e1e943436940d872c9f90ab98b550906.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Four zoo animals are shipped back to their homeland by an animal rights group that feels they belong in the wild. When the ship capsizes, the animals find themselves stranded in Madagascar. Having had humans care for them their entire life, they know nothing about survival and must work together with the locals to help them fit in.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: Madagascar\",\"synopsis\":\"Four zoo animals are shipped back to their homeland by an animal rights group that feels they belong in the wild. When the ship capsizes, the animals find themselves stranded in Madagascar. Having had humans care for them their entire life, they know nothing about survival and must work together with the locals to help them fit in.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Ben Stiller\",\"Chris Rock\",\"David Schwimmer\",\"Jada Pinkett Smith\"],\"direction\":[\"Eric Darnell\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"Contains very mild language and violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":65},{\"id\":\"1000038726\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Stick Man + Superworm\",\"runtime\":4020,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/bf096ea276419a9894da50a007a64f5e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"409904\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Snaddon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jeroen\",\"lastName\":\"Jaspaert\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Sarah\",\"lastName\":\"Scrimgeour\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jac\",\"lastName\":\"Hamman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler - Stickman + Superworm\",\"synopsis\":\"Stick Man lives in the family tree with his Stick Lady Love and their stick children three, and he's heading on an epic adventure across the seasons.\\n\\nSuperworm is super-long and super-strong, and is always saving the day. But who can save him when he gets too full of himself and is captured by the evil Wizard Lizard?\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4c/a3/4ca3ae7776e1a6bdeb2b2bedf63f3ddd.png\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-03-06T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Stick Man + Superworm\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/bf096ea276419a9894da50a007a64f5e.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nSTICK MAN\\nStick Man lives with his lady love and children in his family tree. He sets out on an adventure across seasons with the hope of returning home in time for Christmas.\\n\\nSUPERWORM\\nSuperworm is super-long and super-strong, and is always saving the day. But who can save him when he gets too full of himself and is captured by the evil Wizard Lizard?\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler - Stickman + Superworm\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nSTICK MAN\\nStick Man lives with his lady love and children in his family tree. He sets out on an adventure across seasons with the hope of returning home in time for Christmas.\\n\\nSUPERWORM\\nSuperworm is super-long and super-strong, and is always saving the day. But who can save him when he gets too full of himself and is captured by the evil Wizard Lizard?\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Daniel Snaddon\",\"Jeroen Jaspaert\",\"Sarah Scrimgeour\",\"Jac Hamman\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-03-06T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":71},{\"id\":\"1000038707\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Scarecrows' Wedding + The Smeds and the Smoos\",\"runtime\":3120,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e58d2633ba983b00a6d616361794e3f4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"409885\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Samantha\",\"lastName\":\"Cutler\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jeroen\",\"lastName\":\"Jaspaert\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Snaddon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler - The Scarecrows' Wedding + The Smeds and the Smoos\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a back to back special of The Scarecrows' Wedding and The Smeds and the Smoos\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/de/73/de733948d55168c0cbb1f349a9e3731a.png\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"6209\",\"name\":\"Magic Light Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Scarecrows' Wedding + The Smeds and the Smoos\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/e58d2633ba983b00a6d616361794e3f4.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nTHE SCARECROWS' WEDDING\\nTwo devoted scarecrows, Betty O'Barley and Harry O'Hay, are planning a wedding to remember. When Harry insists on leaving the farm to collect one last thing for their big day, a smooth-talking scarecrow named Reginald Rake swoops in with plans of his own. \\n\\nTHE SMEDS & THE SMOOS\\nBill and Janet fall in love while their families are at war. Faced with disapproval, they flee to a distant planet and Grandma Smoo and Grandpa Smed must put aside their differences and work together to bring them back home.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler - The Scarecrows' Wedding + The Smeds and the Smoos\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nTHE SCARECROWS' WEDDING\\nTwo devoted scarecrows, Betty O'Barley and Harry O'Hay, are planning a wedding to remember. When Harry insists on leaving the farm to collect one last thing for their big day, a smooth-talking scarecrow named Reginald Rake swoops in with plans of his own. \\n\\nTHE SMEDS & THE SMOOS\\nBill and Janet fall in love while their families are at war. Faced with disapproval, they flee to a distant planet and Grandma Smoo and Grandpa Smed must put aside their differences and work together to bring them back home.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[\"Samantha Cutler\",\"Jeroen Jaspaert\",\"Daniel Snaddon\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Magic Light Pictures\"},\"orderIndex\":69},{\"id\":\"1000047203\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Tiddler + Pip & Posy Sandpit Friends\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family, Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1fafd94f7d283b04ef3e4c10db3d9b22.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"419699\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"directors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"releases\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Tiddler + Pip & Posy Sandpit Friends\",\"synopsis\":null,\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1fafd94f7d283b04ef3e4c10db3d9b22.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nTIDDLER\\nA little fish with a big imagination entertains friends with tall tales. One day, Tiddler gets lost but is saved by his own storytelling.\\n\\nPIP AND POSY SANDPIT FRIENDS\\nPip and Posy are best friends whose lives revolve around a wonderful world of play. Packed with warmth and comedy, the series is a joyful celebration of their great friendship, its laughter and games, its ups and downs.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\\n\\n\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: Tiddler + Pip & Posy Sandpit Friends\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nTIDDLER\\nA little fish with a big imagination entertains friends with tall tales. One day, Tiddler gets lost but is saved by his own storytelling.\\n\\nPIP AND POSY SANDPIT FRIENDS\\nPip and Posy are best friends whose lives revolve around a wonderful world of play. Packed with warmth and comedy, the series is a joyful celebration of their great friendship, its laughter and games, its ups and downs.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\\n\\n\",\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{},\"orderIndex\":66},{\"id\":\"1000037595\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Zootropolis 2\",\"runtime\":6480,\"genres\":\"Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fdafe20c7833be3d2fd98f3c63b127bc.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"408400\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Byron\",\"lastName\":\"Howard\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ginnifer\",\"lastName\":\"Goodwin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jason\",\"lastName\":\"Bateman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ke Huy\",\"lastName\":\"Quan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Zootropolis 2\",\"synopsis\":\"In Walt Disney Animation Studios’ “Zootropolis 2,” detectives Judy Hopps (voiced by Ginnifer Goodwin) and Nick Wilde (voiced by Jason Bateman) find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootropolis and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before. Oscar® winner Jared Bush (co-director/co-writer “Zootropolis,” director/co-writer “Encanto”) is directing and writing; Yvett Merino (Oscar-winning producer “Encanto”) produces. “Zootropolis 2” hits theaters in November 2025.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/34/82/3482690efd056bb9af0440b4be087a70.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-01-30T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"mild threat, violence\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"}}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fdafe20c7833be3d2fd98f3c63b127bc.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Detectives Judy Hopps (Ginnifer Goodwin) and Nick Wilde (Jason Bateman) find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootropolis and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/46a15c89ef2be1d71e9c808247b4c05b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: Zootropolis 2\",\"synopsis\":\"Detectives Judy Hopps (Ginnifer Goodwin) and Nick Wilde (Jason Bateman) find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootropolis and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Ginnifer Goodwin\",\"Jason Bateman\",\"Ke Huy Quan\"],\"direction\":[\"Byron Howard\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/46a15c89ef2be1d71e9c808247b4c05b.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/46a15c89ef2be1d71e9c808247b4c05b.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2026-01-30T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"mild threat, violence\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Walt Disney\"},\"orderIndex\":67},{\"id\":\"1000009107\",\"title\":\"Tony\",\"runtime\":null,\"genres\":\"Biopic\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"372124\"],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d5510597239d074ef05e0754ea75a155.jpg\",\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fa/44/fa44d856b2b4daac250e2771c9233699.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/96/7d/967d9ff2361b9c84cbae9abb213183d7.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ab/cc/abcca195a46ed063c6df366cd332788e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3c/97/3c979948c6a4fee5e79570f5c6f0782d.jpeg\"],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Matt\",\"lastName\":\"Johnson (V)\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dominic\",\"lastName\":\"Sessa\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Antonio\",\"lastName\":\"Banderas\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Emilia\",\"lastName\":\"Jones\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Leo\",\"lastName\":\"Woodall\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Stavros\",\"lastName\":\"Halkias\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Tony\",\"synopsis\":\"A 19-year-old Anthony Bourdain travels to Provincetown and stumbles into the chaotic world of a restaurant kitchen, setting off a summer that will shape the course of his life.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTeasers\":[],\"hdTeasers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/54/51/5451f6389ab3d744198b9610fe4eefd9.jpeg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/1c76945aa622bb51cbcce5db2904fd51.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-08-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"localRatings\":[],\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000107175\",\"name\":\"A24\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/d5510597239d074ef05e0754ea75a155.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"A 19-year-old Anthony Bourdain travels to Provincetown and stumbles into the chaotic world of a restaurant kitchen, setting off a summer that will shape the course of his life.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLo